{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.471983+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01a9674aa029634e81c5716e4d0e7ebf0bcbc0bb673a3af9d4acadc124f84bc4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:singulargapgeneral of arXiv:2505.12187, 'Speeding up quantum Markov processes through lifting'] Let $P_t$ be a hypocoercive $C_0$-semigroup with generator $\mathsf{L}$. Then for the decay function $r(t) = C e^{-\nu t}$ in (equation eq:exponentialconverge of the paper), there holds 
