{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.675722+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01c1bc6318455edaf0c3ae9ec8b595f0ac724f73aa1785ce9ae35dc37027eadf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma valueofgradp of arXiv:2411.10235, '\textbf{Smooth transport map via diffusion process}'] For all $f\in L^2(\mathbb{R}^d)$, $t\in [0,1)$ and $x\in \mathbb{R}^d$, we have
