{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.758740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01eb32a7d721e4a4778ebfd40aec295b5aeb79385b1d1b89104c0d562cced0e9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:gmc-full-support of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] For every $x\in\Omega_{\rm tr}$,
\begin{equation}
        M_x(O)>0
