{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.246694+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0226ffd2a31907bb21f33aadf36fb1e770cdad93e32b5857ddd71a65048acb3a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:0 process of arXiv:2607.01946, 'Second-order fluctuations for a phase transition in random partitions'] Suppose that
