   where $\mathcal B = \{ m_j \}_{j =1}^L $ is the extremal basis of conserved quantities, $0 < b < \dfrac{ 1} { \max_{ k \in \Omega_c } |M(e_k )| }  $ and $C \geq \max_{n \in \mathbb N^M } \left( \psi_0 (n) e^{ b |M(n) | } \right) $. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

