{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.936168+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_025af936d3826fcadd282fdd337e6f5544d91c69c39bfb0e8f9cb62d4f7d5b32","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 (Shared-mode coordination) of arXiv:2609.01043, 'From Truncation to Commitment:\\ Persistent Context in Uniform Discrete Diffusion'] For the laws in Equation~\eqref{eq:shared-mode-laws},
\begin{equation}
