{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.580777+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0282d1cf4c9fec8d4ecefa241ea1feebcfdcd79a7d2d1992b89dbee132341f58","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-Stability wp-n of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $\theta\ge0$ and $C_{2,1}>0$ be given in (equation Qn cancel-1 of the paper). The Marcus flow 
		$\wp_n$ given by (equation regular Marcus flow Q2 of the paper) satisfies the following stabilities estimates:
