{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.661004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0318cdd44cfd473e2f1b4c45798a5cdbf2e1f8c7e423f12f32e63ba473ba2615","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:belt of arXiv:2608.28004, 'Hausdorff Dimension of the Set of Extreme Points\\ of a Random Countable Stable Zonotope'] Uniformly in \(n\) and \(Q\in\mathcal Q_n\),
