{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.413418+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_036b2a8b8ba08c3c81c3301484fce45da977ba8173a93c421a3238dbd360c5f9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:LTH_0-2sp of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] Under the Palm probability measure $\mathbb{P}_{\mathcal V }^0$ of handovers, for any parameter $\gamma\geq 0$, the Laplace transform of $\hat{H}^2$ is

