{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.096533+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_043c697c59c11c6a08c120524d98467df32dafeb89a3086c073871448a6a9030","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Explicit fourth-power normalization) of arXiv:2608.20101, '\bfseries Largest bulk gap of the complex Ginibre ensemble'] Under \eqref{eq:Bassumption}, for every \(x\in\R\),
