{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:56.725814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_04b874cf9eec8f0c843065e7a598ce9d2b7810aba9d50eb3a3c8505df912a973","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:bdry_chaining_tail of arXiv:2507.15589, 'Tightness of approximations to metrics on non-simple conformal loop ensemble gaskets'] There exists $\zeta > 0$ such that the following is true. Assume~(equation eq:epsexp2 of the paper). Then
