{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.186957+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0595dd57ed51139236d74c7617de8064c3d70306299331593796445f96b976aa","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, $v\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ and $N\ge 1$, 
