{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.484327+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_06300e9a7310d8c915464c18f4634436e1cf7a2a417859ba4657d5b2a11c9f49","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 54 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $\eta\in (0,1)$, $j\geq 1$, $l\geq 0$, and $b\geq v + 2\lambda + 2\log(2)\pi$.
