{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:31.002219+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_06bd59011c99a5943f203eee290ebc68a76ce621eb638a98105f946edfca766a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 58 (Compact-scale tail) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] If
