{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.672834+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_071a4a9b850b94d3296cf935dc60ce80dea7594af9997b5051398f562f21aa4e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.04853, 'Minimal-Norm Extensions of Stationary Kernels on Subgroups of Locally Compact Abelian Grou'] Let $f \in L^1(G)$ and assume that $\hat{f}\in L^1(\hat{G})$. Then 
