{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:51:44.767386+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07fe7d87994b94f6e8409930c6b9cccf7b5f931685363ba85d7056013dc56df4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2608.26803, 'On bubbling of Fueter maps'] For every $f \in W^{k, p}(M, X)$, the operator 
