        \inf_{\{x : |m(x)|<\varepsilon\}} (\lambda_1 - h(x)) - (1-\frac{1}{N}) \frac{1}{\beta} > (\lambda_1-\lambda_2)(\mathsf{m}_{\textsc{e}}^2 - \varepsilon^2)\,.
