{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.678789+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_091217cc94f67630266be27d7524fdf14f1bcc1ec566ab4e3ab5072d50d65663","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm brownian1 of arXiv:2411.12149, 'Airy limit for $\beta$-additions through Dunkl operators'] [CC]
