{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:12:08.982527+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_094faea4c136e2b5780e13abda439857e8c38c148eae93311fdb1e6249d4c25c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_borellTIS of arXiv:2608.17463, 'Persistence probabilities of fractional L\'evy fields indexed by hyperbolic space and othe'] Let $\mathfrak{M}$ be a metric space and $(X_\eta)_{\eta\in\mathfrak{M}}$ a real-valued centred Gaussian process that is a.s.\ bounded on $\mathfrak{M}$. Then $\expec{\sup_{\eta\in\mathfrak{M}} X_\eta} < \infty$
