&\le-2^{p-1}(p-1)\|u\|^{p-2}_{L^\infty(\mathbb{R}^N)}\Big[\int_{A_3}\frac{w_-^2(x)}{|x-y|^{N+sp}}{\rm d}x{\rm d}y+\frac12\int_{A_4}\frac{\big|w_-(x)-w_-(y)\big|^2}{|x-y|^{N+sp}}{\rm d}x{\rm d}y\\
&\quad +\int_{A_4}\frac{w_-^2(x)}{|x-y^*|^{N+sp}}{\rm d}x{\rm d}y+\int_{U\times (\mathbb{R}^N_+\backslash U)}\frac{w_-^2(x)}{|x-y|^{N+sp}}{\rm d}x{\rm d}y\Big].\\
