{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:28:53.686156+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a3ed26853db568a68f60806054d12cac7e35b029ee40d5fa3f36d7d3e3dfb59","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 19 (a priori total-variation bound) of arXiv:2605.13648, 'Sticky CIR process with potential: invariant measure and exact sampling'] \label[proposition]{thm:ula-bias}
