{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.537859+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b128228f960e3fa3d250950527376485bee914ba1b83845dedf17a5faf56ba2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:LG-H8 of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The dressed observable satisfies the mixed diamond
