{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:22:01.678629+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b48b21f6093df6a5d31fbe8a6fd68163017635e642cd29b1b3eab41550d2f80","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Question of arXiv:2605.02226, 'Finitely Dependent Processes on Subshifts'] \begin{enumerate}
