{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:10.026874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b4ce8ecdd15a31b574109ac1963b158c559eea318b7dcb18b7fee47996e466a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 31 (Homogeneous case) of arXiv:2608.17374, '\textbf{On the Pseudo-Mixing of Kac's Walk}'] For homogeneous $T\in \mathbb{R}^{[n]^d\times [n]^d}$ define
