	and the multivariate Mittag-Leffler function is defined in \eqref{multML}.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.359318+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b57559bb793ddbfe2d4496cff41853af5c1d44b440aac553e3cf2a4df4b53d7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm th.oL of arXiv:2411.13099, 'Long time behavior of killed Feynman-Kac semigroups with singular Schr{ö}dinger potentials'] Let   $(Q_t^{oL},t\ge 0)$ be defined in (equation eq.FK-sur1 of the paper). Then:
\begin{enumerate}
