Then, 
for all  $p\in (1,+\infty)$,    $(Q_t^{oL},t\ge 0)$   is $\mathbf W^{1/p}$ compact-ergodic over $\mathscr O$. If moreover  $\mathscr R^d_0\setminus \overline{\mathscr O}$ is non-empty or  if  $\mathscr O=\mathscr R^d_0$, then $\lambda_p>  \inf_{\mathscr O} \mathbf V_{\mathbf S}$  where $\lambda_p$
 is the principal eigenvalue of $(Q^{oL}_t,t\ge 0)$ in   $ b\mathcal B_{\mathbf W^{1/p}}(\mathscr O)$.
