{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.056897+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b57a38fe3409937fba587da416af2f857ebabb4db93c08e0c466e3a31d9c7e1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] Let $t>0$ and $q\in\mcl Q_{\upa,c}^\D$ for some $c>0$. There is a constant $b>0$ such that
