{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.340313+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b59608b9eb1dcd38e5351043feab6d77fcbaf5185f4c4f3aff79232ad297c12","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2607.23791, 'Precise cover times for branching random walks on Hamming graphs: (iterated) logarithmic c'] For every integer $P\ge2$ and every $0\le\gamma<P-1$, for $d$ large enough,
