{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:47:53.345639+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c5da3a93388876b9ecc386d1dee79c5be7146810bb3edbc3e9ffba67c8e3fd5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 34 of arXiv:2607.14948, 'Graph alignment in sparse inhomogeneous models via self-overlap'] The following hold with high probability.

