{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.146315+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0cf2a65127c74f7420da9f63f6de559c3196861880806ad316ed39cf6175dfb7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 (Distributional recursion for \(\Svar^{(n)}\)) of arXiv:2604.13149, 'The Distributional Tail of Worst--Case Quickselect'] For every \(n\ge 0\),
