{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.394245+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d57ca38ec46c10fcaf81d8b85402f7b00c5b231b4ead83a4488069db974730c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:weightedbochner of arXiv:2608.29657, 'Hypocoercivity of Tempered Bouncy Particle Samplers for Heavy-Tailed Targets'] For $g \in C_c^3({\mathbb R}^d)$,
