       \bigg| \int_{I^k} (   a_i-   x_i)\qdif(\x,\dr \bfa) -   {\mathpzc F}(   \beta)\bigg| &\leq Ce^{C\cdot A} \bigg(|   \beta|^{2p-1}e^{-\frac1{\Con} \min_{i<j}|   x_i-   x_j|} +|   \beta|^{A}\bigg)
       \\\bigg| \int_{I^k} (   a_i-   x_i)(   a_i-   x_i)^T\qdif(\x,\dr \bfa)-\mathpzc G(\beta)\bigg| &\leq Ce^{C\cdot A} \bigg(|   \beta|^{2p-2}e^{-\frac1{\Con} \min_{i<j}|   x_i-   x_j|}+|   \beta|^{A-1}\bigg)\\\bigg| \int_{I^k} (   a_i-   x_i)(   a_j-   x_j)^T\qdif(\x,\dr \bfa)-   {\mathpzc F(\beta)}  {\mathpzc F(\beta)}^T\bigg| &\leq Ce^{C\cdot A} \bigg(|   \beta|^{2p-2}e^{-\frac1{\Con} \min_{i<j}|   x_i-   x_j|}+|   \beta|^{A-1}\bigg).
