{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.770832+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0ebf2fcb404db3d983f3295e84b881341782a66e9597d57788c7a11abfcd0bbe","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 42 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Fix $q \in (0,1)$, $c \in [0, q^{-1})$, and set
