{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.665840+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f071916f46d6a595ac45b8f71b6da56d0cd12cbd066fb3f8b39ee33e4b6fe73","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop auxiliary-one-sided-line-crossing of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] Let $h_\ell\to\infty$ and $h_\ell=o(\log\ell)$, and put
