{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.497848+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f4a6671cb74b641552c1a1268045d8e97401fa07fcec375f1878f6866202327","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma two point commutation of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] For adjacent growth points $x, y \in \mathbb{R}$ (no marked points $\{z_1,z_2,\ldots,z_n\}$  are between $x$ and $y$). If the system
