{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.724726+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f8d07fc7c16ac681edf59c048360c790c269d7b7c7345d0611d8afb1e70207a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2511.13559, 'Asymptotic analysis of rare events in high dimensions'] Let $X\sim\mathcal N(0_d, (\la H)^{-1})$ and $q, \Delta$ be as in Lemma~\ref{lma:BD}. We have
