{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.298911+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0fa7107a9cad87f1856adf301742210ec77d04e76f12004098cc4a82ef911894","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] For $\mu \in \cP_2(\mathbb{R}^d)$ which satisfies \eqref{theta}, and any $\nu \in \cP_2(\mathbb{R}^d)$, it holds that
