{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.459263+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0fc6e31cc9259d623b029458b07ea7f477396a1fb9c08416e8330198d82ad7d6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 45 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] There exists some positive constant $C$ independent of $n$, $s$ and $t$ such that
