			In addition, \(\Vert (y_{.+2r}^\xi(\omega), (y^{\xi})^{\prime}_{.+2r}(\omega))\Vert_{\mathscr{D}_{\mathbf{B}(\theta_{2r}\omega)}^{\gamma}([-r,0])} \in {L}^{p}(\Omega)\) for every \(p \geq 1\).","status":"unverified"}

