{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.315147+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_114bc4d13c6534db97a9b89d13eacc0efb50625f55d1defb23fada5f643102e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 58 of arXiv:2608.05931, 'Effective Lagrangian regularity and the uniqueness threshold for random H\"older velocity '] Let $d \geq 3$ and let $(Z_\ell)_{\ell \geq 1}$ be a sequence of independent $\R^d$-valued Gaussian random variables with
