{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.755754+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11f602707edba296f1c085db5a953ba793910b1e135c3a50a976e39306278d33","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:absolute-compensators-paper of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] Fix \(d\in\mathfrak D_{\xi,n}^{\mathrm{osc}}\), and write \(m=m_{\xi,d}\). Define
\[
\mathfrak C^{\mathrm{pre}}_{\xi,d,n}
