&\hspace{4.5cm} \lesssim  {\frac{l}{\epsilon N}} +\epsilon ( l B + 1 + l) + \sum_{j = 2}^{l} \sum_{p=1}^{j-1} \binom{j-1}{p} \frac{2 l}{\epsilon^{p-1} N ^p} {+ \frac{1}{B}},
