{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.027874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_12ebba3a3daf43e78a2330496a1fbcc9b61966ba4f0b70733e0d9ec2d26aa6d6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l2 of arXiv:2412.04015, 'Linear fluctuation of interfaces in Glauber-Kawasaki dynamics'] Fix $1\le j\le d$. Then, there exists a finite constant
