{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:12:08.988035+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_130e5d76b8f221b04fe818d33c38250e7cf49b19e08a290fbe9d4112c732b37a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_hfbmUpperBound of arXiv:2608.17463, 'Persistence probabilities of fractional L\'evy fields indexed by hyperbolic space and othe'] Let $(X_H(\eta))_{\eta\in\mathbb{H}_{d}}$ be the hyperbolic fractional L\'evy field on $\mathbb{H}_{d}$ and let $R>0$. Then, for some constant $c>0$,
