{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.697585+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_132bd3e02ee24b132c7b711e90bae9eb52e577ef7f013fd99c01a9d2b69e664e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma p<2 moment bound for uniform on disk of arXiv:2605.29095, 'Asymptotics of the number of components of random polynomial lemniscates'] [Ghosh-numberofcomponents]
