{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.579193+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_135cc1a65865888493ddd1fafc53079418c772360dc0108818a97b1634cd6659","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 17 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $f\in \Leb^2(\Rbb^n,\gamma_n)$ and $t\geq 0$,
