{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.066576+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1452ea8687513ae49cdb212fca67c0cd17f9714eda36d646849c86912d919fb3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2606.27520, 'Critical curve of loop percolation on the $d$-regular tree'] Let $\alpha>0$ and $\kappa\geq\kappa_c$. For all distinct vertices $u$ and $v$,  
