{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.957975+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1531bf7c195a7850b325ff2ec56ea7235d3ac3aac372f90f6394ca0aff213dd3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:local-mass of arXiv:2607.14087, 'Stochastic Domination of Gaussian Maxima: A Resolution of the Weak Simplex Conjecture'] \label[lemma]{lem:local-centering}
For $a,b,s$ as above,
\begin{align}
 \int f_{a,b}\,d\gamma_1
