{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.586601+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15c212c87f63da409dd6485a12c3c4489315ac0b25f2d706f8abb54cded2f8f0","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 (Two-parameter Mittag--Leffler function) of arXiv:2608.25164, 'A time-fractional Kalman filter'] For $z,\alpha,\beta\in\mathbb C$ with
