{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.796796+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_18e4965ea99145335cdfc7e684e141fae89ad4db79fa92f7e368419c21d86b0f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 66 of arXiv:2608.30549, '\vspace{-1cm}Maximally Spread Out Measures and Implications\\{} for Phase Transitions in A'] Let $\emptyset \ne \Omega \subset \RR^d$ be an open and bounded subset.
Let $A_1,A_2\in \{B,F\}$.
