{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.811149+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_193bb475ecf6f0c3347cbc656a25aee1a4e8d7cb28a627716d644d41d3252d0b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma_cadlag of arXiv:2603.26307, '\LARGE The incompressible Navier--Stokes--Fourier system with thermal noise'] Let Assumption (Ass:noise of the paper) hold and $(\Omega,\mathfrak{A},\mathbb{P})$, $\mathscr{F}$, $(W_n)_{n\in \mathbb{Z}^3}$, $(B_n)_{n\in \mathbb{Z}^3}$, 
