	for all $\eta \in C^{{\infty}}(\mathbb{T}^3)$ and  $t\in [0,T)$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:09.889577+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_193f003e34d956197473d497c73e30f984da39b56d1b4ff22a4757560b5ce95f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:convergence of arXiv:2607.18824, 'Non-Abelian multiplicative chaos on the circle'] Fix $\varrho$ as above and $\kappa<\min(-2\check h,-\check h-2\lambda_\rho^+)$, with $\lambda_\rho^+$ defined in (equation eq:lambda_rho of the paper).

