{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:31:14.333389+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19544fa29de5f0f100d3ed3a8f58bc7d3928ccec00b2c123fa045679a950853d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eigenvalue_cond of arXiv:2606.16609, 'On stability of outliers from the circular law'] Let $\lambda \notin \mathrm{Sp}(D_N)$, then 
