{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:38.642641+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1990b82faf7f14361d3bd34bd7c0ee6c92e97ff67e8578d11668181ffa6e5bb3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2506.18063, 'Reduced critical branching processes in non-favorable random environment \thanks{ This wor'] If Condition B1 is valid, then, for any $z\in
