{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.459996+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a5c90cc62de05b6e9769ab30da3c532412acf90b4cd49e6f5b208e21817caf8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2609.03191, 'On lifting representations and actions on curves of the metacyclic groups $C_{p^s}\rtimes '] Let $V$ be a $k[H]$-module such that it has a rational lift $\mathcal V$ to $R$ with $r_{\mathcal V}=0$. Then $V$ has an increasing, separated, and exhaustive filtration
