{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.921543+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a9c8241e9194532369a45fa63b1f4d8aef6716bfb45955f508ea826cdf0b917","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:residualest of arXiv:2601.21762, 'Navier-Stokes with a fractional transport noise as a limit of multi-scale dynamics'] Let $u$ be a URD solution to (equation eq:modeleqn of the paper). 
