{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.061464+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1be3974650e11639a08dd8760b35e05f91ef2c6ad75afdcd34c3305e63845030","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm exact ruin  for the collective model of arXiv:2606.28031, 'Insurance risk models in a heterogeneous time-dependent population: scaling limits and rui'] Assume:
