{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.139023+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1c26924263c227b19d324d61112d372a6a8a195ecd35ccc39722481b7c66ddc9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2608.27569, 'Laplace and Dolbeault operators on Sasakian manifolds'] On the $\left( 2n+1\right) $-dimensional
Sasakian manifold with Lefschetz operator $L$ and adjoint $\Lambda $ and operator $H$, we have for all positive integers $b$, 
\begin{align*}
