{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.251092+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1cafe2aa5d505f464777bbb5b3e3b52f338c6e3442da928a6c304de211cffabd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: upper bound for path with loops of arXiv:2411.16398, 'Large Deviations of Cover Time of Tori in Dimensions $d\geq 3$'] For any $\omega \in \mathcal{A}$, where $\mathcal{A}$ is an $(\boldsymbol{F},\varepsilon,M_0)$-good path collection, we have 
