{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.711896+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d6d25f99ab9f25237fec65b45592d90f8889180588f0944089576a8714ac020","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:big of arXiv:2605.30017, 'Conditional Probability Spaces and the Structure of Agreement\footnote{We thank Emiliano C'] Let $(\mathcal G, p)$ be a CPS and let $\widehat{\mathcal G}$ be the $1$-augmentation of $\mathcal G$. Then:
