    where the support is defined w.r.t.\ the topology on $C_0$ induced by $\| \cdot \|_{\infty}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.385748+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d746bd2d89af3dfacacbbb177670933b2f9c2bc1e036e78dbcb5cd3d43c9b5b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:global_clt_intro of arXiv:2507.10531, 'Quantitative central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] Define
