{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.370098+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d9987db77ad40d41a8dcf5d665870a789f47ecdc95876dadb6ee568464766f1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lem lim sum diff of arXiv:2604.15146, 'Renormalised two-point functions of CLE$_4$ gaskets'] The following convergence holds:
