{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.604952+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ef071f82088c93605aed9f44c94ef33ca36976590b050c30225f4add8c6b328","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t:pdmpgs of arXiv:2604.03979, 'Stationary Distributions in Monotone Markov Models: Theory and Applications'] If (ass:flow,a:pdmpm of the paper) hold, then the PDMP is globally stable, with a
