{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.016469+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f430f2c19546fb6c56b6d7a2e7557833dbd691a54db7422dc5370088b3c3523","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2605.05864, 'Classification and Metrization of Classes of Smooth measures'] It holds that
