{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.460474+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f5c21b5e0cb563a43d58c310e06f89a327365ce90cdf6b2414e64ef641d2794","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2609.03191, 'On lifting representations and actions on curves of the metacyclic groups $C_{p^s}\rtimes '] The following properties hold.

