\end{equation}
where $L\in \mathbb N$ depends only on $\pi_{A,B}$. The points $(x,m)=(e_k, m_{2c}(e_k))$ are the real solutions to
\begin{equation}
f(x,m)=0, \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{\partial f}{\partial m}(x,m) = 0. 
