Finally, $e_1 = {\rm O}(1)$, $m_{1c}(e_1) \in (-(\max_{\mu}\sigma_\mu^b)^{-1}, 0)$, and $m_{2c}(e_1) \in (-(\max_i \sigma_{i}^a)^{-1}, 0)$.","status":"unverified"}

