{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:50:30.561837+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f97b4f81e2b04e16236be9199bd26e30a951fe7f9ae8e77e96c6d0aedb63dc0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2605.30560, 'Projected McKean--Vlasov Dynamics for Entropic Weak Optimal Transport'] When $d=1$ and $\mu,\nu \in \Pc_2(\R)$, for any $\pi\in\Pi(\mu,\nu)$,
