{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:07.077898+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1fe16a7e3c073d5b27b150320159eb4013e04fdadfea19543c5db515fe581cc4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 (Global spectral budget) of arXiv:2608.27657, '\bfseries Stein Kernels and Normal Approximation\\ for Log-Concave Bilinear Forms'] Under the same assumptions, the covariance operator satisfies
