{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.385311+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_219e779998358007a1c56692ce5e12cf81f1ec1099768870bd61410417745759","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor_join_bounds of arXiv:2411.02046, 'Speed of Convergence and Moderate Deviations of FPP on Random Geometric Graphs'] For~$x$ and~$t$ as in Lemma~(lem_T_t_and_T of the paper), we have
	\begin{equation}
