           R_\varrho (\CalW)
           \,\,:\,\,
           \begin{array}{c}
                \text{$\CalW$ neural network weights with}\\ 
           \| \CalW \|_{\ell^0} \leq n, \,\,
           \| \CalW \|_{\ell^\infty} \leq C_0, \,\,
           L(\CalW) \leq L_0, \,\,
           d_{\mathrm{in}}(\CalW) = d, \,\,
