{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:29:14.933800+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_232b7c4bb523bf886679d348625c83db6f8a3ddf8f519b8ec97da98d42ef7ba7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop.GreenEstimateDeg2 of arXiv:2606.13442, 'Scaling limit of additive functionals for reversible non-gradient exclusion process: criti'] We have the following estimates for the Green function $\overline{G}_\lambda$.
