{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.825800+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_23f7c456c5fec3d219c9bf2ed7ff8bf1117b127e922d4146094dd13696aaccd9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 36 (Uniform chain remainders) of arXiv:2607.19752, 'Weak Equilibrium Measures and Capacity--Hitting Identities\\ for the Hypoelliptic Third-Or'] There exists $t_0>0$ such that, for every $k\ge0$ and $m\ge1$, there is a
constant $C_{k,m}$ satisfying, for all $0\le\delta\le1$, $z\in K_0$, and
$0<t\le t_0$,
\[
\begin{aligned}
    Z_s^\delta\Sigma_r
    &=
    \begin{pmatrix}
        S_r\\
        -sJ_{x^1}B_2^{\delta,\mathsf O}(z)S_r\\
        \frac{s^2}{2}
        J_{x^2}B_3^{\delta,\mathsf O}(z)
        J_{x^1}B_2^{\delta,\mathsf O}(z)S_r
    \end{pmatrix}
    +
    \begin{pmatrix}
        \overline R_s^{\,1}\\
        \overline R_s^{\,2}\\
        \overline R_s^{\,3}
    \end{pmatrix},
    \qquad 0\le s\le t,
\end{aligned}
\]
where, for $\ell=1,2,3$,
\[
    \sup_{\substack{0\le\delta\le1\\z\in K_0\\0<s\le t_0}}
    s^{-(\ell-1/2)}
    \left\|\overline R_s^{\,\ell}\right\|_{k,m}
    \le C_{k,m}.
\]
Equivalently,
\begin{equation}
    T_t^{-1}\left(A_3^\delta(z)\right)^{-1}
    Z_{tu}^{\delta,z}\Sigma_r
    =
    t^{-1/2}\left(G(u)+\mathcal R_{t,u}^\delta(z)\right),
    \qquad 0\le u\le1,
\end{equation}
where the $\ell$-th block satisfies
\begin{equation}
    \left\|\mathcal R_{t,u}^{\delta,\ell}(z)\right\|_{k,m}
    \le C_{k,m}t^{1/2}u^{\ell-1/2},
    \qquad 0\le u\le1,\quad \ell=1,2,3.
\end{equation}
Moreover, for every $m\ge1$,
\[
    \sup_{\substack{0\le\delta\le1\\z\in K_0\\0<t\le t_0}}
    \mathbb E_z\left[\left\|T_t^{-1}Z_t^\delta T_t\right\|^m\right]<\infty.
\]","status":"unverified"}

