{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.709907+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24bb9d694488eee7f385c9e54fae74b6e56a776971965e9b27c3035d15501d3e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem flow of arXiv:2604.10509, 'Nonequilibrium fluctuations and moderate deviations for the occupation time of the SSEP wi'] There exists a flow $\phi_\ell$ connecting $\delta_0$ and $q_\ell$ such that
