{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:24:20.646270+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_26061c5812906bff224d26e937bc06c35e9aebdd4f6e3fb7162d7ae0f0172b83","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:master-common-diagonal of arXiv:2608.11084, 'Sharp Frobenius-Norm Concentration for Sample Moment Tensors'] Let \(X_1,\ldots,X_N\) be i.i.d. copies of a centered sub-Gaussian random
