{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:26:02.533804+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2692c6f9b184bf408c670a52a6cea043110cc0a4170bea1a4ec26aa5766cd06d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn genfineslopetop of arXiv:2608.30031, 'Ziggurats, taut foliations, and contact structures'] For $s\in \mathbb{R}$, we declare the following set to be open in $\widehat{\mathscr{S}}$:
