{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:31.001461+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_26940886f1b780ca39e6d39e95dbc19082b3260f9cdd859b744084631d48d393","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 52 (Triangular canonical extraction) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] Run the stages in the lexicographic order
