where $\mathcal{L}_Q^{\#}$ denotes the sharp Lebesgue-energy of the local solution $(v^{N,\delta},\pi^{N,\delta},(\widetilde{\pi}^{N,\delta}_{k,\alpha})_{k,\alpha})$ at the (large) scale $Q$, i.e.,
\begin{align}
\nonumber
