{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.965409+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_26def3d4c8fab44cbc3ecc712c10c202a2ec3e18e17d6d329127c40ea97ddc16","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm defectiveLSI of arXiv:2412.03560, 'Non-asymptotic entropic bounds for non-linear kinetic Langevin sampler with second-order s'] Let $\varepsilon\in(0,1)$. Suppose Assumptions~(assu:semiconvexbound of the paper) and (assu:Poincare of the paper) hold with $\lambda<1/2$. Introduce the following notations:
