{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.748768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2711fe621af31ad0313e9dbbf2b5ba59ee0ea760b67547afe4a7cb180e8bc929","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:star-equation-fourier-paper of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] For every 
