{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.933941+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_272e46e0eb8943c7cc4e1ee8a0ad4e4b16580a55d32455c5a80af8af5811b4f6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm entropy_free_energy of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] The limiting \textit{entropy per dimer} for $\mu_{n,N,w}$ exists as $n,N\to \infty$ and is given by 
