{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:14:37.649796+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2853ba656e6067ad5b81170d8ac1649d4502201b839523eed6ec575bad2563f3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 of arXiv:2608.19560, '\textbf{Computing transient probabilities in Markovian queues with balking conditional on '] For a fixed $J \in \{1,2,\ldots\}$, $\widetilde{\bm{p}}^{(J)}(t)$ is given by

