uniformly over integer $T$ with $1 \leq T \leq N^m$, for every $N$ large enough. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.377058+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_28c985894ffb88d4ed7079b257d31732b1502e5091fe2c2befd88c2f76f6cbea","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:secondorder of arXiv:2412.01995, 'Exciting games and Monge-Amp\`{e}re equations'] Suppose $C>10$ and denote $\iota=\frac{1}{4e^{C+10}}$. Then we have 
