}\end{equation*}
  \item If \(L(n) \to +\infty\) then this \(\Tree_{n}\)-walk is
recurrent:
\begin{equation*}{
\frac{R^{\theta}(\Tree_{n})}{n} \xrightarrow[n \to +\infty]{(\P)}  0.
}\end{equation*}
\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

