{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.244979+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_29070aa7cd7ad505a162772a263514902082cbcd022bdd26243ce0b7777f2287","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 (the map is a contraction) of arXiv:2609.01093, 'Ideal MHD below the classical well-posedness threshold'] With $T_*$ chosen by \eqref{eq:Tstar}, the map $\mathcal M$ satisfies
