{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.778253+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2926ed298662f2a571bdd3ab1dbd962ff7a41ca2258f6b9df3da3277dda4f51b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] The function $\psi$ defined in \eqref{eqn-regular-potential}  is of $C^2$ class and 
