{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:14:37.640765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a29af32481ba2680e3bde23c7b70a6c29162c9473b3cda2ec1e4bfb5e2aea32","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Extratheorem 6 of arXiv:2608.19179, 'A random walk on $p$-groups with a symmetric perfect pairing'] \cite[Theorem 2]{Woodetal}
