{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.779842+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2cb78f39f260aa75825912a39d8c0d64874b01ec66af06db4b45de67c866ad3d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:born-binomial-starts of arXiv:2608.01253, 'The pseudo-quantum representation of \\finite reversible Markov chains'] Suppose the symmetric urn starts from $\mathrm{Binomial}(n,p_0)$, where
