{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.741272+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2d10a50fc00e25c8a906583fa3a33dd9ea35b4f8330d40b3392abf9461da8149","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main_spectral of arXiv:2603.24803, 'Critical Spectral Invariants in Random Walks with Geometric Resetting'] The ruin probability under geometric resetting with rate $\gamma \in (0,1)$ 
