{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.501114+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e0b8b5ea06532fc83911389d036e0f43129a70c5d56e30fde8fefeeaaa3e260","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:squarefree-profile-error of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:squarefree-rank-one}
