\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.666318+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e12a94502bf2e148e7dbb27904208fb722ee04b03da6a2e45a4dfc3da31b996","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma \cite{BravDaiMiya2023} Lemma 2.12 of arXiv:2411.00930, '\bf \Large Asymptotic Product-form Steady-state for Multiclass Queueing Networks: A Reentr'] As $r\to0$,
