{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.955880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e62f4970429ef32271aa8cab0fd0bc9803a8006004fc6220c24da93667b749b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:h_inverse of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] The characteristic sub-gamma function $h(u) = 1 + u - \sqrt{1+2u}$ 
