{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.063551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2f4b0bd1394d390d80298c9b91901ab44729739f0364f8d42ea61d6e1cd7db4b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2606.17452, 'Optional Stopping for Superhedging Supermartingales'] Let $\tau$ a stopping time and $H^k=(H^k_i)_{i\ge 0},\;k=1,2$ sequences of non-anticipative functions. For $S\in\Se, j\ge 0$ define the following functions on $\mathcal{S}_{(S,j)}$:
