{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.038355+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_312c907670cf27966c1641c76288d6b1ed4c988f328776863cef6d445d02d316","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Assume  the notation of Lemma \ref{lemma 4.23.3} and let
