{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.662037+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_314cbd0eae2b3c34467750bb478083b4ca95904031829b05d485beacd19658f6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2605.09372, 'Sharp weighted norm estimates for martingale square functions'] Let $1<p<\infty$. Given  a matrix weight $W\in A_p$, we have
