{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.789301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31685c00032b58bd50003f400a903cd88b1344bb0fcdabf5fb0fce288c65d787","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 21 of arXiv:2609.02261, 'Quantization and process'] Set, for $\theta>0$, $\alpha\in\N$ and $x\in\R$,

