{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.472772+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_328797de6b0e744d11b2e060ce3fa605165fa3901256b08ed47c162dbc3d877c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eq:Gaussian-jet-law of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[proposition]{prop:Gaussian-jet}
