{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.494095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3304b05425d5167bc4e824b595b4b9852a0d6828cdca1142da601dd9abf463ab","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2512.02538, 'On the spectral geometry of Liouville quantum gravity'] \begin{equation}
