{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.643962+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_335109acb12e59fe8caebbd6794f41bb89d562c619caa7d6c8b6ab456749d038","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 (Terminal diffuseness) of arXiv:2608.30715, 'Endpoint Energy Atoms Force Local Pressure Concentration in Three-Dimensional Navier--Stok'] For each fixed \(\tau\in(s,T_*)\), the fields \(z_\tau\), \(v_\tau=\Pp z_\tau\),
