\item 
$\mathbb{P}=\mathcal{P}_{\mathbb{X}}\left(\mathcal{P}_{V_{\gamma}}\left(v_{\gamma}\right)\right)$. 
\end{longlist}

It will be proved that $\mathbb{P}\left(\Pi\right)=1$, and  is referred to as a measure of uncertain probability.","status":"unverified"}

