{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:52.237621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_34cb3f0729c5ee5c2c1cd2d6cd5df76dbeef478f50a3ff0537a689fa876f3854","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2512.10686, 'Maximal rigidity of random measures and uniqueness pairs: stealthy processes, quasicrystal'] [\cite{Shapiro},Theorem A']
