{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.585751+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_360b6babf868df4eda3a0505db93c5439273a73af0024577135490e01daf33ba","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm.Regularity of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] The process $L^\xi_\zeta$ is locally H\"older continuous with index strictly less than $1/2$. 
