{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:29:21.939610+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_360b894b4ecdc183a288b7c49296efa7dcdb5dff93276a19eb83f54110421bb8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (First-order functional limit) of arXiv:2608.01674, '\textbf{Limit Theorems for Tempered Linear Processes with Innovations in the Domain of Att'] Let \cref{ass:innovations,ass:filter,ass:tempering} hold and let
