{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.695868+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3705ad561edcd7d65f7ee47d64a5f99a00610a7b68d9c4e058f6b154e6bed07b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:convex of arXiv:2510.22778, 'Free denoising diffusion models'] Let $\mu_{0},\mu_{1}$ have finite second moment and finite logarithmic energy, and let
