{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.492033+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_37430fcf9fe7a562b5fa1c58305943e7f8d776b6c67fc58f4b77d52bd1aafd16","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainthm 2 of arXiv:2609.02576, 'Sharp estimates for the Jacobi and trigonometric Dunkl heat kernels'] Let $\al\geq\beta\geq -1/2$, $\al>-1/2$. The non-compact Jacobi heat kernel satisfies  the bound
	\begin{multline*}
