{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.644838+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_37b628776126a69d82082808004a396105012ed77730a981129ca0450d5cf34d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 2 of arXiv:2609.00719, 'On the Aleksandrov--Bakelman--Pucci estimates for the weighted $1$-Laplacian'] Let $F\in C(\Omega\times\mathcal S^n)$ and $f\in C(\overline\Omega)$.
