    \end{align}
    Moreover, for every $\alpha < 1/2$ it holds 
    $$\mathbb{E}\left[ \|(I-\Delta)\phi\|_{W^{\alpha,p}(0, T; W')}\right] \le C$$","status":"unverified"}

