{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.895734+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_380c17e0d570638eb1cdd02b99cfa06119407a29ae216f7d35a6ed89fb0932ce","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop weak_sec_H_-1 of arXiv:2411.06861, 'Quenched invariance principle for random walks in random environments admitting a cycle de'] Under the same assumption of Lemma (lem:corrector_construction of the paper), 

  \begin{enumerate}[(i)]
