{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.041787+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38182dc370fd4167bbcf7e498977cb047f6e3b2f7e1385cf51f2251f25bbe8d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 50 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Let   $\kappa\in[0,1)$, $\rho\in(0,\rho_{b}]$,  and let $\tau$ be a stopping time  $y$ be $\cF_{\tau}$-measurable $\bR^{d}$-valued.
