{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.276155+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_39a215ccd6ad326af2e48d07b427f974b449ab22a12f41ed464ef4d3e910cd98","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Bessel-zero obstruction for \({}_0F_1\)-gamma deformations) of arXiv:2606.22066, 'A Bessel-zero obstruction to hyperbolic complete monotonicity of noncentral chi-square den'] Let \(a,b>0\) and \(\theta\ge0\).  Then
