{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.671106+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3af4c8327c90e4541a8b5e5b655792d556116bce7ed8a014ab8682665559f8e9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2604.24392, 'Numerical approximation of Markovian BSDEs in infinite horizon and elliptic PDEs'] Assume  \eqref{as:generatorf} and \eqref{as:b:sigma}.
