{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.078030+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3af934ed32d7b8c47244c5dc37c442a7da99aeaef87c30d381094ef467a56aeb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2609.03793, 'Typical martingale diverges on a co-$\sigma$-porous set'] Let $\alpha>0$ and $r_0>0$ be arbitrary. Let also $F\subset 2^\N$ be such that
