{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.736876+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b9f3c9a597a4ab5974e20a6b319f72b58f93d72f8714300b1ebeedc9fb8397c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 31 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] Let \(Z_n^{\mathrm{grid}}\) and \(\widehat{\PP}_n^{\mathrm{grid}}\) be given by
\begin{equation}
