{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.605488+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3c209afa66b9e864ec79392f5ae65fa31f136eab354b156acdc453d33deeeb47","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 4 of arXiv:2607.08129, '2607.08129'] Under the assumptions in  \eqref{eq:MDP-scale},
\[
 \frac{\log L_n-\E\log L_n}
 {b_n\sqrt{n\log n}}
