{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.726041+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3c5abe9b8506897f02ceacb101335e93bf4de5c2ecf5a6e08961cde04004bf40","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2609.01190, 'Rough differential equations on manifolds via natural bundles'] The estimate 
