{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.354318+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3cfbf2d676c82838cba1056342f1e0beabf81f619aecd678ad007c15b7a05122","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor.dpi of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] Fix $p > 4$ and $(t_0,m_0) \in [0,1) \times \mathcal{P}_p({\mathbb R})$. Let $(m,\alpha) \in \mathcal{A}(t_0,m_0)$ be such that
