{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.248837+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d33ad4f829c74929de8c9d400adfee60b2eb474ace0c5d4c8322b73f0d2cab6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma mshe of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp With notation to be explained afterwards, we have the following \abbr{SPDE}:

