{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.643858+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d3923af1342298f8186dfb31e2fb38ca3926b4562336f86d2dc3e7811ac8d61","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (Passive Nash smoothing) of arXiv:2608.30715, 'Endpoint Energy Atoms Force Local Pressure Concentration in Three-Dimensional Navier--Stok'] Let \(z=S(t,\tau)h\) solve \eqref{eq:passive}. For
