{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.541503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d4fe0936222f0d81d6727fe51f8b2390123beb8c8822ae688f2b023afacf0ab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:turning_point of arXiv:2603.27906, 'Marked GUE-corners process in doubly periodic dimer models'] For~$k=1,\dots,\ell$, set~$a_k=\alpha_k\beta_{k-1}^{-1}$ and~$b_k=\alpha_k^{-1}\beta_k$. Then
