{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.791857+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3fbced33ac80162830c69efeb855ac312a36de306970138d622e41b1dd9e3d60","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 18 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Assume that $(\Omega, \mathscr{F}, \mathbb{F},\mathbb{P})$
