{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.499004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ffbd5897da7e0487d0c10de0943c1a26f74ba979ce7e5cf7d40f26d43463c9c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:RBJ-scalar of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The one-point Fredholm determinant
