{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.584614+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40bdd16f39ff602e56175e52616487226a0cc83dca307817c9b8438c7f38e900","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:unmatched-conditions of arXiv:2411.09716, 'Stable Tables'] For regular preferences $\pi\in \Pi_n$, there is a unique stable matching $\mu_\pi$, and
