{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:06.982760+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42881d99a9313a568776f3d7127ed350884823bea9db6adbeb91a9c84ffbfa4e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary thm:lbstrthm3 of arXiv:2607.26551, 'An RDT based confirmation of Lehner's formula for Kronecker-Gaussian matrices'] Assume the setup of Theorem (thm:lbstrthm1 of the paper). Let $\bar{L}$ be as in ((eq:hrd9b0 of the paper)). Set 
 \begin{eqnarray}


