{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.380521+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42b9f56be32b9471470b9c05301c8b50b87c9036d6e0b43f339815cf6db24be7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2609.03195, 'Lecture hall polytopes and\\Lakshmibai-Seshadri paths'] \begin{itemize}
