{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:35:05.839502+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42ba715e3284f956fa84f6fa8bf59453a632616468ab7df536b18351dada3036","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop radial-incidence of arXiv:2606.26049, '\textsc{Face volume densities of positive-intensity and ideal Poisson--Voronoi tessellatio'] Let \(d\geq2\), let \(k\in\{0,1,\ldots,d-1\}\), and put \(q= d-k\).
