{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.146414+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4539a57b07950e834967e49b351d1f606e68c178789d7ad010419ad5fb1bc923","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 (H\"older / log-convexity) of arXiv:2604.13149, 'The Distributional Tail of Worst--Case Quickselect'] For every \(n\ge 0\), every \(\theta> 0\), and every \(u\in[0,1]\),
\begin{equation}
