{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.766844+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_46459f44f39a1b0b8de86ddbe69b92a4c083fb7678377942f1993707e674918f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 4 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Fix $q \in (0,1)$, $c \in [0, q^{-1})$, $N \in \mathbb{N}$ and let $\lpplen = \{\lpplinen_{i}\}_{i \geq 1}$ be as in (\ref{Eq.Deflpplen}). We define the constants
\begin{equation}
\begin{split}
