{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095418+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_47bbf1e71d54c51bef7b92074015ad23e0475afa6033789c4fe653c0e0edf09c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem11 of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Assume ((h of the paper)).
