{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.762285+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4824970325bf32e343db9cdd3559b1f8b1b69c51840bc8456ea40ffc88d819b7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lmm Disjoint Sets of arXiv:2609.02682, 'LDP for tensor forms'] If $D_1,\dots,D_v\subseteq[n]$ are pairwise disjoint, then
