{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.414589+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_491caa18687810eb49e1d643359056a5991c51aeff0f398da439bd12a52acd56","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 82 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] For each $h \in [H]$, we define two holomorphic functions $\phi^+_h$ and $\phi_h^-$ in $\amsmathbb{M}_{h}$, which satisfy
