{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.733159+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_49324ee4ea764329408a1c96ea7a2cf898154e18a0292d807642ed7efe6f413f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:sharp-hitting-magnetization-zero of arXiv:2604.20008, 'Mixing times of Langevin dynamics for \\ spiked matrix models'] Initialized from $\pi^+$, the hitting time to the set $\{m=0\}$, denoted $\tau_{m=0}$ satisfies 
