{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.189401+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_49ba39ce77ef8dd7a6832f36cce3c7486507b3f836bb42501010491ee8e5eb16","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:optsimp of arXiv:2603.01322, 'Gibbs conditioning, atypical consensus and splitting Gibbs measures on random regular grap'] For all $c\neq  \sref,$  define
\begin{align}

