{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:10.808271+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_49f9e932493153a3f793d51a6a3b764005f58155520a392acd8d2844bb762ca5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] Let $I^\varepsilon$ be defined by 
