{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.829615+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4aed8c41bac23255f6437d7d608a4fe454989768c94f03bf6a94e2741faf86db","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:hawkes-identifiability of arXiv:2606.28869, '\bfseries A General Theory of Paths:\\ \large Signatures, Jump Lifts, and Expected Signatu'] Assume $\lambda_0=\ell=\mu$ and $\alpha>0$. Let
\begin{equation}
