{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.299083+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4c547304876a18f0949a4e1b97face43bb4f8ab42ed84baaee75c6075f26c4b4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] Let $\mu, \nu \in \cP_2(\RR^d)$. Then
