{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.701432+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ca9e804ced0855131fd799cf21f13e2416528e37b37f2a729a076bcd753833a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:opvol of arXiv:2510.22778, 'Free denoising diffusion models'] Let $f:\mathbb{R}\to\mathbb{R}$ be bounded and continuous, $b:\mathbb{R}\to\mathbb{R}$ bounded and Lipschitz, and let
