{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.081880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4cf7677d4cd3077c5e2da5aecf3925743063c141534d460524528a179d81e9e4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2609.03803, 'List-distance consistent vertices in trees are confined to a path'] Let $G=SP(w;\ell_1,\dots,\ell_k)$ with $k\ge3$ and $\ell_1\ge2$. Then
