{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.255181+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d35ecfcdb1c4fed9607256d7a676f3f1860cbe1c4e5ac5ac81c35493cd882b6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 31 (Resistance metric, {\cite[Definition 2.3.2) of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] {Kig01}}]
