{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.576554+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e7ef72e73a7ae13f851da5d4f3cfe5a6ee164ac831d175e36435708e0d8cd17","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:tri_st of arXiv:2602.05317, 'Strong local nondeterminism for stochastic time-fractional\\ slow and fast diffusion equat'] Let $t > 0$, let $\theta < 0$, and let $\zeta \in \mathbb{R}$. Then, the following two inequalities hold
