{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.594885+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50a7844bccd7bbe5727ce8286906c63fb48fbf1c8f5b103bbd3f30c7011520b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 (Truncation error) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] Under the same assumptions of \cref{thm:sequence-statistical}, the truncated posterior computed by  \cref{alg:spectral} satisfies
