{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.369896+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50bbc65db5c61aa60544ea93f3a35013f9e158e208d0537a10f418902ba3bd73","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:ap1:superposition of arXiv:2412.07710, 'An H-theorem for a conditional McKean-Vlasov process related to interacting diffusions on '] Suppose $f:[0, T] \times \ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^m \rightarrow \ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^m$ satisfies a linear growth condition. Suppose $\mu_0 \in \mathcal{P}(\ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^m)$ satisfies
