{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.542838+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_514d11db23cd79671df224edf823df169d86bb97bf0b07853ff80852fb32952e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 (Truncated spacetime estimate) of arXiv:2608.25971, 'Positive \texorpdfstring{$\tau$}{tau}-bi-Ricci curvature and Mean curvature flow with surg'] Fix $\eta>0$ under \eqref{eq:normalized-space-form-setting}, and choose $ r>{(n+2)}/{2}$.  
