{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.086580+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_51742bb1129b3330195e8c62c54ef87a2ddaa36a317b287ed4204b16b5a59907","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 8 of arXiv:2609.03819, 'Stochastic damped wave and Euler-Bernoulli equations with singular locally H\"older contin'] {\cite[Theorem 6.2.2 and Proposition 6.2.9]{Dap-Zab2002}}
