{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.418509+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52037ccade46b9392e4c5c3cb8a8ac55b728a1842520a426f57d6e960d11944e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 113 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] $\mathcal{D}^{\textnormal{off}}$ is the open subset of $\mathcal D$ of Definition~\ref{Definition_ZW_set}, consisting of points such that
