{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.538234+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_522461ea2860eb15c0aa475cce826e3b5fab3ebac99574049c68a6a854bd4550","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:GLPP-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] Let $H = \ell^2(\mathbb{Z})$.  The seed functions
