{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.781803+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_522785b1a26a9f404a93059ff0ac6b776bec8f37794f08e2508369cd324b8f3d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm Semicircular Cov of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] We have
