 N\leq 2s m^{s-1}
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:12:08.990055+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_523065067a5f41aa1918419ba897f4e312a0bb6a923a43043c8f5b5153cbb1c9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop prop_selfSimRiemann of arXiv:2608.17463, 'Persistence probabilities of fractional L\'evy fields indexed by hyperbolic space and othe'] Let $\kappa\in\mathbb{R}$, let $(X_H(\eta))_{\eta\in\mathcal{M}_\kappa}$ be the fractional L\'evy field on the model space $\mathcal{M}_\kappa$ and let $0<r< \inj_{\mathcal{M}_\kappa}(O)$. For any $a>0$ we have
