{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.191369+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_53d18e6ac22bca77812db55ac46a1bb36568a90d73dded53d91790a0b988a0f4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 11 of arXiv:2606.31287, '\bf Heat kernel lower bound estimates for symmetric pure jump processes via averaged jump '] Suppose that   ${\rm J}_{\phi,\le}$ and ${\rm CSJ} (\phi)$ hold. 
