{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.110013+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_54477d65b48f7acda6f52aae09e060b7c4df566133bedb7c58c3c0211bdeb0c4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 33 of arXiv:2608.27374, '\Large \bf Distribution-constrained optimal multiple stopping: the Root-type solution'] Suppose that \(\sigma^\xi\) is a finite iterated lower-barrier time,
