{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:25.273470+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_54e89d8cdeae14ca20a51deb24f51bba688c3aae92a0bc4065c9779dabe87ff4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 23 of arXiv:2606.21111, 'On Elephant Random Walk with Delayed Amnesia'] The following almost sure convergence results hold true:\\
