{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.056540+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5545035dd80194b891f42eee6adf113c3d6324f5a45e7a77d31bc57018120383","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo thm:Rmin of arXiv:2607.14062, 'Gilbert's disc model conditioned on the square lattice'] \begin{enumerate}
