{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.893918+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56447347a8565b54e3ca3761a912b7cda41ec8b2db2678bb77928d3a102b3343","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 12 of arXiv:2606.18877, 'Ergodic Properties of Non-Linear Density-Dependent Perturbations of the Ornstein--Uhlenbec'] The density \(p_t\) can be represented as
