{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.364600+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56570c490d3b05f9b46788c3119796547690e485b850ed53b8163a13c7ff257f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:delgdmom of arXiv:2606.02472, 'Correlated uniform attachment trees'] Let $T_n\sim \mathrm{UA}(n)$. For any $\delta\in (0, 0.01)$,  
