{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.040097+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56b3c0b7096ee7d7bdcc564e81c7c1366b91c51a4b801725269de11ca85f04de","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Suppose that $p\geq q$ and
