{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.446073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56ffca4c7c304888f30be6aad1509ab4f82794836fcff3b895ee00802fa6d6ec","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:block of arXiv:2508.17838, '\bf Edge Universality for Inhomogeneous Random Matrices'] If   there exist $\theta$ and $t_N$ such that  \(\theta t_N\ll N^{1/3}\) and    
