{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.532353+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_571624b5c672648dfce2774a46145445fa3dbbbfa12fb0a9979746bad68cc25d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 (Mean-field Stein--Langevin dissipation) of arXiv:2608.28827, 'Quantitative Target Convergence and Uniform-in-Time\\ Propagation of Chaos for Langevin-Re'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:core-target} and either kernel assumption, the map
