{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.626520+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57eba6a3991c0d496eef0f7289f2d7b217574dd22cb3d10b5fc50f5bd5e57b1b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem point-absorption of arXiv:2609.01300, 'Virasoro Constraints for Orbifold Curves'] Let \(L\) be a finite totally ordered set of identity labels with variables
