{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.299167+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_585aa4ff39a4a8c8354b02d53c87a9fb46868c13353e18f26a28f0d0e554912e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] Suppose that $\mu$, $\nu$ satisfy \eqref{theta}.
