{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.211032+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5888bba338f99bf38193f4e0b3f692204d020360d7491d0690a0a5c147c80275","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn def:HTD of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] Given $\sigma\in\mathbb{R}^{d}$ and $r_{\star}\le d$, define
