The supercritical coefficient is the one in Theorem~(thm:main of the paper). (Stated as a conjecture by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.061852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_58a87686080cbaa6fef51d622cc2210544750262abbd50434aee2e5c221a90df","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:4.6-fw of arXiv:2607.14993, 'Sharp phase transition for percolation with short-range dependencies'] Let $n \in \mathbb N^*$.
