{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.288810+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_58bec2959bc0103dcf54bb4d170c4bb3756500b6810ccbe5bc61f261a373a845","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:martingale-CLT of arXiv:2604.21142, 'Gaussian fluctuations for Internal DLA on cylinders'] Let $(\ensuremath{\mathcal X}_{k,n})_{k\leq t_n } $ be a martingale difference array with respect to $(\ensuremath{\mathcal F}_{k,n} )_{k\leq t_n }$. Assume that: 
