{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.241335+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_599d083864ab0b0cf4dee31268cfc3f8720860924968a3c58e2d6d45250c778f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:two-atom-contrast of arXiv:2608.20295, 'Physical-Support Confidence Sets for Highly Coherent Dictionaries'] Let $r=2$ and write
