{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.502657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a7c30fa88e1bfa70a9c948769ec446e1ab7979f90ce0cb7de995ae06433a481","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2605.30030, 'Critical exponents for planar random-cluster model with cluster-weight~$q=4$'] There exists~$c >0$ such that the following holds. 
