{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.781557+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a7e8dd5236465c706f63ead40879bf7d8f008836c12b8c6347a0b0daf9cd2d7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop vartheta = theta + epsilon of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] On the event $A_k$ defined in Lemma (Concentration for specific functionals of theta of the paper), for $n$ sufficiently large, we have,
