{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.637106+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5aeaaae106bf2ac336d3028b6a42c487031013ec0aa3c532706cfc7003892d1a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2605.31300, 'Cone-Additive Functions for Random Walks on Free Products of Graphs'] For $R\in(0,\mathcal{R})$, we have
