{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.070448+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5af3a2d6218d7e53db8c44f7a4067bfeca49a6a0e0e3c79daeca40d07371f5e0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo thm:RSW-s-embeddings of arXiv:2509.08928, 'The near critical random bond Ising model via embedding deformation'] In the previous setup, there exist $c(r_0,\theta_0)>0$, only depending on $r_0,\theta_0$, such that
