{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.062835+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ca612471ffe58b10fd630b9298516150f179cba2d3eaa63a248356394174b09","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2606.28067, 'Ergodic approximation for the invariant distribution: An abstract framework for law-depend'] Let $b$ and $\sigma$ satisfy the conditions~(equation M1 of the paper) and~(equation M2 of the paper) above with $\bar{b} >L$. 
