{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:35:04.198851+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5caa52872d67f671b4079a38b707ddc803f0dab26758f7c4d830c606dbe4840c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2608.03497, 'Connective Constants on Nested Fractal Graphs'] There is a polynomial map
