{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.330256+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5cdbe7ef14c1f67ef230c8ee3b88c30dc6e38fb8cee5fdb6f81913f81eed13f6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 3 of arXiv:2607.23640, '{\sl Non-equilibrium fluctuations of a two-species exclusion process with slow boundary }'] For each $k\in\mathbb N\cup\{0\}$ and $\bm f\in \mathscr S^\dagger $, define the seminorm
