If $F(x_+)>F(x_-)$, then
\begin{align}

   \lambda_\beta^{(1)}
   =
     \sum_{j=1}^{m_0}
   \frac{C_j\alpha_j}{2\pi C_+}\,
   e^{-\beta\left(h-F(x_+)\right)}    \left(1+O(\beta^{-1/2})\right).      \end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

