{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.123644+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d6797e7ad957b4db3e2db1c2380e63484f1c9c327df41119a4c7a4b6e52b0fc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 28 of arXiv:2608.26642, '2608.26642'] Assume that $\P_0[X_1^2]<\infty$. If a function $f\in L_{loc}^1(\R)$ satisfies
