{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.142872+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d73799a075bed7c7ed3c07a414d9c8ba1c5c3c57150bf12334f414a57355e71","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 of arXiv:2604.05910, '\textbf{Well-posedness and Hurst parameter estimation for fluid equations driven by fracti'] {\em(Young integral)}
