{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:44:24.753388+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5daddae5e6d740f5bbd7e16dfbcd8d8d831752bb31c49bc2d6b7bd7cb7a9a3bb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop PropEntireEvolGL of arXiv:2605.06429, '\large \bf $\mathsf{GL}_N(\mathbb{C})$ BROWNIAN MOTION AND STOCHASTIC PDE ON ENTIRE FUNCTI'] Let $\theta\in \mathbb{R}$ and suppose $\mathfrak{gl}_{0;N} \overset{N \to \infty}{\longrightarrow} \mathfrak{E}_{\boldsymbol{v}}^+$ in $\mathfrak{LP}_+$. Then, as $N\to \infty$,
