{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.954439+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5db45ff6a6cffb324492836e30dfc9882c46cebc1173fa0cad992b809e906e16","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:conc_density of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] Let $(X_t)_{t \geq 0}$ be an ergodic diffusion with invariant measure $\mu$, let
$\overline{\rho}_t(V)$ denote the empirical density according to Definition~(def:empirical_density of the paper) with 
