{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.447257+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e3d3abe2746f6871d97a9ef21850b5dd93da6608aed221704734ad0b8f6276b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn non-separableplanar-embedded of arXiv:2411.11676, 'Surface sums for lattice Yang--Mills in the large-$N$ limit'] Fix a loop $\ell$ and a plaquette assignment $K$ such that the pair $(\ell,K)$ is balanced.
