{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.590119+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ed710fce90ae19e66300ca358b64fa9bb4030df22d880df30df4df3a70c9548","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma HR of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] Assume that $\varphi^\prime(0)\geq 0$, the process $L^Y_k$ equals in distribution to the unique strong solution to the stochastic Volterra equation
 \begin{eqnarray}
