{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.634238+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f3474feeb8e8d7ea20d34d334ee4ace62e7ea8f5ca930671824bd3400e022dc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop-quantum-zipper-ns of arXiv:2411.19810, 'Radial conformal welding in Liouville quantum gravity'] In the above setting, the law of $(\psi, \eta)$ is 
