{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.258780+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f54a3ebeba3d150bf014bcd24741caf2256352075d4626483a665a7c50e1915","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2604.19308, '\textbf{On McKean--Vlasov SDEs with polynomial drifts for SIS epidemic models}'] For $a,b,d\in\R$ and $y\geq 0$ it holds that
