{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.760569+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f8dd4b356102a60a087cecfe5e026b516b31f07096ee029f5e211f0170792ff","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2605.14254, '2605.14254'] Let $t > 0$, $g : (0,+\infty) \longrightarrow \mathbb{R}$ be a Borel function such that
