{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.729229+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fb002fba1d1632add0cc3c21a841120d260034e8ba5d26ffe629bfd7082f90a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:OU-back-time-used of arXiv:2604.20008, 'Mixing times of Langevin dynamics for \\ spiked matrix models'] Given $0<y_0<y_1$, let $Y_t$ be the solution to ~(equation eq:Y_t-OU of the paper) started from $Y_ 0= y_1$, 
