{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.360662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fca2fefad3a5d945372715484bf86a284dd9af686dc5e755061bf5cb2670aa2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] $\big(\widetilde{N}_j:h_*< j\le h^*\big)$ are independent. Each $\widetilde{N}_j$ follows the same law as 
