{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.764566+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61271f7bf9ffab51baba2de44236b0a817028426369d53414725203e5f237ca1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:lbm-finite-energy-simple-response of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] Let $x\in\Omega_{\rm LBM}$, let $\Lambda_n^x$ be a simple eigenvalue
