{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.864381+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_612f291107af2c6014f8e7c7998edcd9f0e0a713d6607f485ce7dedbe413205b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2609.02426, 'Deformations of the $\osp(n|2)$-action on the superspace\\ of symbols of differential oper'] Let $1\leq k\leq m$ and put $a^k_1=\Delta_1A_k$, $a^k_2=\Delta_2A_k$. Then, as cochains on
