{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.983567+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6201ed7181eb3933719df6273c9891c1e2d12a50950c8cc1461968ebaec38c0f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Subcritical rigidity) of arXiv:2609.03339, 'Exterior Serrin Rigidity for the Homogeneous \texorpdfstring{$k$}{k}-Hessian Equation\\'] Let $2\le k<\frac{n}{2}$ and let $\Omega\Subset\R^n$ be smooth,
