{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:43:53.645800+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6254868c032742245854f09e5702f3b1a49cb0740e27121db34b5f95d3de8d6f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:root degree of arXiv:2512.17747, 'On exponentially height-penalized random trees'] Let $\mu=\mu_n$ such that $1\ll\mu\ll n^{1/4}$.
