{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.574007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62cae0cdc6aae2752dc5f0583dde9727523619fe865dcf086a25377324a8b43a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 1 of arXiv:2609.01850, 'A comparison theorem for relative regular holonomic $\shd$-modules'] Let $F$ be an object of $\rD^\rb_{\Rc}(\pOS)$. Then, the support of $F$ satisfies: 
