{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.421399+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62cc3c4da72fb861666adfd4d53b02346293ca2a7fdf269ec304159f819393c1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Weibull tail index of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[definition]{def:stretched-tail}
