{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.922935+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62dee5c6eb1b89642dc169d0e468284c324eb07a46ccad609b32650a45ddf1e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 (What is this $\eta$ for, really?) of arXiv:2609.00974, 'On Algebraic Integrability\\ of Vector Fields \\ with Rational Function Coefficients\\ tha'] The condition (2b) in Theorem \ref{thm: main: n=1, p>0} can be equivalently restated: 
