{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.222329+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62edfed9b00bb5d4a5f6cd5ce739fcdab6e6cec5de271f53a1693628d3aed8b1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 (Total-variation estimate on the fixed domain) of arXiv:2609.00501, 'Uniqueness of Finite-Time Varifold Limits for the M\"obius-Invariant Willmore Flow'] Assume \eqref{eq:un}.  For every $0<s<t<T$,
