{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.414957+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64ad841771d4bb2dd81d1ca7ffc585f594de99887ae58282e56dc0b4f28ebeb1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 87 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Under Assumptions~\ref{Assumption_A} and \ref{Assumption_B}, the density of the equilibrium measure can be computed for $h \in [H]$ through
