{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.411832+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64e0303b26ef1206c5d3f0f789c6b4349ae7d341ab7aeca887d268c07bbc40a3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:sum_over_blocks of arXiv:2601.07808, 'Supercritical long-range percolation on graphs of polynomial growth: the truncated one-arm'] \label[lemma]{lem:sum_over_blocks}
