{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.132601+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_656e1a54b982e11ad7141a16a61c28acdd88aeef5bcdd1d6f452a3310fb660e9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:DmTilLDevForm of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] One has 
