{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.730279+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65c41f68f92a1f67845992a14df37e6a131063e436f25f2a694aa30a07c93619","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:asympdfold of arXiv:2606.08325, 'Digit Mixing under Polynomial Maps'] For $1\leq k\leq d$, we define
			\begin{equation}
