{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:08.851449+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65ec56a4808cf9238c1898b1ca7a5fe70e8d070e9b3c82e95f19bac5447bdf29","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2511.11189, 'Sharp asymptotics for the maximal distance from the boundary to the nucleus of a typical P'] When \(t\rightarrow\infty\),
