{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.610709+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65fd42fe2fd8ccc6809c0075fd15f3933f5b75035a0de63a82156bddf184cea8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 (Bobkov and Ledoux, {\cite[Theorem 5.1) of arXiv:2608.25772, 'Propagation of Chaos and Gaussian Fluctuations for Mean-field Coupled Maps'] {BL19}}]
