{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.584894+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66a523893bec1d58c15a15b0dd33b2c39c3c984cbc0771e7bcffb5b9ee7bd0d3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem cost=lim_wasserstein of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] Let $\Pi_i\in \mathcal P_{s,1}( \mathsf{S})$, $i=0,1$. Then 
