Here and after the asterisk on the sum over $\chi$ in \eqref{cubiccharsum} restricts the sum to primitive characters and $\chi_0$ denotes the principal character, while the asterisk on the sum over $\chi$ in \eqref{quarticcharsum} limits the sum to primitive characters $\chi$ such that $\chi^2$ remains primitive.","status":"unverified"}

