{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:26:47.163741+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_690c9ef6015c95b4c322105abdbe3ae01b20bd46d709a41fa4ce700b447d8cb9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Ppn 28 of arXiv:2608.29416, 'Algorithmic threshold for high-dimensional projection pursuit I: general theory'] For $F_\diamond$ as in \eqref{e:fp-Fdiam} and $F^{\rvi}$ as in \eqref{e:F.rvi}, we have
