{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.061232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_694eeaebeae8c208ccc1c79e8e58427664722aabb66e0d86a0923d0c5da06ed4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2607.14993, 'Sharp phase transition for percolation with short-range dependencies'] With the assumptions of Lemma~(lem:ineq-pivot-site-bond of the paper),
