Then $X$ is an $S$-valued $\mathcal{V}$-holomorphic process and for all $\mathbf{u}\in\mathcal{V}^*$, $\mathcal{A}h_\mathbf{u}=h_{L(\mathbf{u})}|_S$, where $L:\mathcal{V}^*\rightarrow \mathcal{S}^*$ is the operator defined in equation (equation eq:OpLu of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

