{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.723766+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b2be8ce9efa6fe67b605c17b51c1cb1d609da09b8a6bf7c3cf91c3baf42429e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 (Uniform index separation) of arXiv:2608.06523, 'On the Gardner Transition in the Ising Pure $p$-Spin Glass II'] If $p\geq4$ and
