{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.617489+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6bf5e1b1128163597ab9dc086ec09677953be8a97ace9d6b6ab99a9a1e72ec34","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 27 of arXiv:2506.09592, 'Extremal process of the local time of simple\\random walk on a regular tree'] Let $\wt C_\star:=2c_\star\slb$ for~$c_\star$ as in Proposition~\ref{prop-3}. Then
