{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.474348+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6bf9ae532966840867b1fd3fa48f18c3f2973e7593e07d6b05165d222b1a922e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq:uncut-dereg-limit of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[theorem]{thm:dereg-variational}
Let \(V\) be continuous and bounded below.  Then
\begin{align}
 &\lim_{(\varepsilon,\eta)\to(0,0)}
