{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.169332+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6bfc8fb2210a1e82f5d2e376c8944cd364eff7a3f5ea58d80a0ee8475cfe3192","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2609.01774, 'Hypoellipticity on time-periodic space-times'] If $\mathcal{M}=\Sb^1_t \times\Sb^1_x$ then for any $m \in (0,1)$
