{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.259279+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d644cca4ed888b1461ae3a2d258d2c399e3ee3e295842f7fcd9d24f8213bcf2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 93 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Suppose that $\mu$ satisfies $\rm{(A1)}$ and
