{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.242846+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d7fc25f7a9b5f037fad9756d1263832325190295c7b60fa96411b4cb68c0d4a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop opti_problem_231 of arXiv:2604.23751, 'Large deviation principles for pattern-avoiding permutations, and limit shapes for constra'] The action $A_{\beta}$ has a unique minimizer $\varphi_\beta$ in $\mathcal{E}$. 
