{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.234304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d832392cca0ec9741f8e9af05e48b641fbc5525a747c232ef623010b0e06734","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2609.00567, 'Hodge--Tate splitting and Akizuki--Nakano vanishing in positive characteristic'] Consider a pullback square of fpqc algebraic stacks
