& = \bigg(\frac{1}{\theta} \int_{0}^{\theta\hat{m}} \int_{0}^{\theta\hat{m}} \log|x - y|\,\dd x\,\dd y\bigg)\N^2 +\theta \hat m \N \log \N \\
