{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:17:04.321899+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6e7c05eb6553b7eab9e0ea196cf869791352a405b771b22239fb7ae2017fd61b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem main subspace dependent theorem of arXiv:2606.01683, 'Singular-value gap of nonreversible Markov processes'] In the above setting, assume $\gamma_V > 0$. Then 
    \begin{align*}


