{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.061498+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6fce30a65a3964e439b45e6bdaa4d8b693e796b0da1863b835621e2d84ba4e31","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Coro phase-sep-pq of arXiv:2607.14993, 'Sharp phase transition for percolation with short-range dependencies'] The following statements hold.
