with initial condition $J(0,x)=0$ for $x>0$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.851688+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_720e42b25046bc5d30af6e68da1bd12361807c0bace6669b4d52828a10fb1616","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 12 of arXiv:2609.02017, 'Optimal girth-dependent bounds for the Bethe approximation of the permanent'] For $u\in L$, define
