{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:29:21.898730+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73dc84da6d34d6d43a60a2931ee2154fa9e203ca5057599fb1a5d16ba863a385","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2608.00449, 'First-order phase transitions in the hard-core model'] \label[proposition]{prop:rationbrs}
