{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.844392+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73e27920cbd4bb9ba341e973d021273124860b88d58199105a05f869fd6b7356","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 8 of arXiv:2609.03840, 'Haglund--Haiman--Loehr formula via Carlsson--Mellit algebra'] Let \( \tau \in \SYT(n), \pi \in \Dyck(n, k) \) and
