{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.932944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73ec499d1578f54383168720411795acf25d0805a37409aa9f65e63d6014d82c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:B-inverse of arXiv:2602.07920, 'On the position matrix of single-shelf shuffle and card guessing'] The matrix $B$ is invertible. Its inverse $B^{-1}$ is lower triangular with
