{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.755894+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7432fde3de09b3fb15f2ab4c7a5e7a965cd68821d5aa57abe1ab8c2286a1d09d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 50 of arXiv:2609.03836, 'Koszul Orlik--Solomon Algebras from Non-supersolvable Arrangements'] \label[Cor]{prop:gquadratic}
    Let $M = P_f(M', M'')$ be a parallel connection.
