{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.724857+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_74426ec5bec3ba80487381de9ca684f1d6cfd0e0f08276e4a4420a3c27684045","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary prop:affine_Levy of arXiv:2411.04238, 'Holomorphic jump-diffusions'] Let $X=(X_t)_{t\in[0,T]}$ be an $S$-valued jump-diffusion with characteristics $(b,a,K)$ and extended generator $\mathcal A$. Assume that $b,a,\lambda\in\mathcal O(S)$ and $K(x,d\xi)=\lambda(x)F(d\xi)$. Let $G\in (0,\infty]^d$ satisfy (equation eqnG of the paper) and set
