{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.538573+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77b10ee2d49b3b46006ceee3913859d62e1ad5c8f1afb2fc49dd3a3be2226125","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:GLPP-H4p of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The dressed observable satisfies the mixed diamond
