{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.276748+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_78a30dc7236aedd6d74904c0036fad3bdbfc16057661ccb106f12d02db3cc4d8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 (Signed Bell generating function) of arXiv:2606.22066, 'A Bessel-zero obstruction to hyperbolic complete monotonicity of noncentral chi-square den'] With \(d_m\) as in Proposition~\ref{prop:bell-obstruction},
\begin{equation}

