{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.907169+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7927a6fa34c7b647219996ba6b4a45022139739c2d991b23607958011ef77a38","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:truncation-coupling of arXiv:2608.26745, 'Moderate Deviations for the Largest Eigenvalue of a Randomly Deformed Gaussian Unitary Ens'] There are constants $c,C>0$ such that
