{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.360010+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_793139a636a13ad0a6d87d2997dab507d7cbd8877a5f272df0b022f95725fcbb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm th.Ress of arXiv:2411.13099, 'Long time behavior of killed Feynman-Kac semigroups with singular Schr{ö}dinger potentials'] Assume  {\rm \textbf{[c1]}} or {\rm \textbf{[c2]}} and assume also    {\rm \textbf{[S1]}} or {\rm \textbf{[S2]}}.   
