{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.185702+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_79334ffafa21d57a98394283caf67995807988e10672e724c585622d2996cf07","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$ and $v\neq w\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ with $|v-w|\ge 10d$, 
