The claim follows.
\end{proof} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.934949+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7938f8461e64dbf8dfc72540ebab27e03f695f70ee9b397e81cd31b637d15b76","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:u-left-nonzero of arXiv:2602.07920, 'On the position matrix of single-shelf shuffle and card guessing'] Fix $i\in \mathcal{E}_n$. For $0\leq t\leq n-1$
