F_X(\tfrac{x}{\theta})F_X(\tfrac{x}{1-\theta})\leq F_X(x),\quad\forall x\geq0,\,\theta\in(0,1).
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.662555+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a71916885f5d54d4c15126517b749e687ff48ac60e47b5f3c1dc7b7e9346488","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2605.09372, 'Sharp weighted norm estimates for martingale square functions'] Let $1<p<\infty$. Given a matrix weight $W\in A_p$, we have
