{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.069335+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ca35684624c031a34d5018a9868ac9f641fc25b15721a2eeb79e3651feb0c7a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2606.27774, 'Variational Formulas for the Spectrum of\\ Block Wishart Matrices'] For $\bS\in\bbH_+^k$ and $\bT\in \sa{k}{\C}$,
