{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:32:56.091101+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d8ef38e8fbec277fc2b525586b1ade92b2963712a12ae04512239f7a8bc8238","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem coro:reconstruccionRhoX of arXiv:2411.12717, 'Excursion theory for Markov processes indexed by Lévy trees'] Under $P$ and $N$ and  for each $t \geq 0$,  the following convergence holds a.e. 
