{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.772878+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7eb017d84e306889bf562e9c2135273597c90d70f804b42a51c9a13c877b799f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop1 of arXiv:2608.00295, 'Quadratic Perturbations of Markov Systems'] Let $A_1=	\begin{pmatrix}
