         \mathbb{E} \left[\exp\left(\bracket{\bm p}{\sigX[] \otimes \sigW[t,T]}\right) \right] = \bracket{\bm u_t}{\sigX[]}\,, \quad \sigX[] \in G\,, \quad t \in [0, T]\,.
