{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.283092+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7fdf128c84ffc95718b0025f05e2511043b08f322c2c6948cc0d76e640064011","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2606.22656, 'Fluctuations of Point Vortex Ensembles\\ at Small Negative Inverse Temperature'] For every $0<\beta<\beta_0$,
