In particular, $\mathscr{A}_m$, $\mathscr{L}_a\mathscr{A}_m$ and $\mathscr{A}_m\mathscr{L}_a(1-\Pi_v)$ extend uniquely to bounded operators on $\Lmuz$ with the same bounds, and if $\varepsilon<\sqrt m$ then
