with equality if and only if $p = 1/2$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.125036+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8134f2d3a50a85557ece929938b27c10c58c30a9d767290342e2de7831f924ab","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:arc-variation-estimate of arXiv:2607.15966, 'Canonical Mandelbrot Cascades on Curves Are Rajchman'] For every \(\xi\neq0\) and \(d\in \mathfrak D_{\xi}\),
