{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.492606+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81944f7e9e2467f50cad0d8b15882fad1963fe5aa5ac28160525357fb9219e04","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2512.02538, 'On the spectral geometry of Liouville quantum gravity'] \begin{equation}
