{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.132462+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_81cdcdf6bf48bcaf212132179309b38657f696eaec6d51701d38655818df184d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:DmTilLForm of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] For any $m\geqslant1,$ one has
