 Then $\overrightarrow{F}$ is the unique vector field satisfying  $\theta (\overrightarrow{F}) = F$  and  $$  {\rm Lie}_{\overrightarrow{F}} \theta = -\frac{1}{2} \frac{\p F}{\p t} \theta.$$","status":"unverified"}

