{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.414380+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_841bcf6af33583b32f34fb2142a9a46bb0b69e223293d740b24e10758a1f21a4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:pair-easy of arXiv:2601.07808, 'Supercritical long-range percolation on graphs of polynomial growth: the truncated one-arm'] \label[lemma]{lem:trivial_isoperimetry}
