         \wass(\sL(W_n),\sL(Z)) \leq \frac{c(N,\beta)}{\sqrt{n}}.
    \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.343701+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_847804895883a7e0c4abf183c5d0459aff890e935d0b1ae530782ba916336864","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thmISPHyper of arXiv:2411.05534, 'Inverse problems for stochastic partial differential equations'] Let $ h \in L^{2}_{\mathbb{F}}(0,T; H^{1}(G')) $, $ g \in L^{2}_{\mathbb{F}}(0,T; H^{1}(G)) $ and $ R \in C^{3}(\overline{Q}) $ satisfy 
