{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.318689+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8582a97f2961797282841d4093a97f83804a3601d54bccb04a4c58e8c153c890","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 27 (Exact fixed-weight formula) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] For $a > 0$ and $p \in (0, 1/2]$,
