{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.257182+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8584466fc3b2c6c14089b5d86953bafc5c4342d020c7926c9f67c062f64cf346","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 of arXiv:2604.19308, '\textbf{On McKean--Vlasov SDEs with polynomial drifts for SIS epidemic models}'] Let $p=1$ and~\eqref{co:1}--\eqref{co:3} be satisfied. Then~\eqref{eq:SIS epidemic model} admits a unique strong solution $I$ such that $I_{0} = \xi_{0}$ a.s.~and
