{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:48:02.403765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85de7cf1d9b9234458c9c533bcce3ecea7a66649c32d112e6ce89cd98374dfdf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem prime gaps of arXiv:2608.25889, 'Slope Inequalities for the Geography Problem of Spin Symplectic 4-Manifolds'] {\rm (cf.~Theorem~1 in [bhp])}
