{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.246632+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88373768fda32bdeb5b3a4c826fc6ef7c17f13b1de50302542f481facf2099db","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:crit of arXiv:2607.01946, 'Second-order fluctuations for a phase transition in random partitions'] If $j_n = \floor{rn^{\alpha/(1+\alpha)}}$ for $r>0$, then
