{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:07.078246+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_88c394d0822028f00b71a854bff19bb61b55afaf3b98e79688fc594e02b17fb7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 10 (Log-concave approximation) of arXiv:2608.27657, '\bfseries Stein Kernels and Normal Approximation\\ for Log-Concave Bilinear Forms'] Assume the estimates in \cref{thm:letwin}.  Every isotropic log-concave
