{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.492373+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_892eb16d021612251cb41d39cd306e30b3ea00dedec28d468613f8ea56fbc9a0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm 5 of arXiv:2609.02576, 'Sharp estimates for the Jacobi and trigonometric Dunkl heat kernels'] Let $\psi\in C^2((0,\infty)^3)$. The following formula is valid
