{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:15.354360+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8ad81da7d6c2b1cc9d6f3e9eb0fafc8c09f9f6edbcf3bbc553aa3077019adb87","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[10 20 of arXiv:2607.12303, 'Marginal Stationary Distributions and Convergence Rates of Higher Order Markov Chains'] {\rm

