{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.728711+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b1238026b2276b29a58b79d939ee33c64677a4b645851b7c47df756628477e0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm moment of arXiv:2503.22334, 'Probabilistic analysis of optimal multi-pivot QuickSort'] Let $K\in {\mathbb N}$. For the number $X_n$ of key comparisons using optimal $K$-pivot QuickSort we have 
