{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:30:28.829445+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8ba41973769192a68e1edefd2238137d84821185e68e894d25a4acbae4dddc28","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 33 of arXiv:2609.02105, 'Contact fundamental forms and \\ adjoint varieties'] Let $\fg=\fg_{-2}\oplus\fg_{-1}\oplus\fg_0\oplus\fg_1\oplus\fg_2$
