{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.849775+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8bebe3610c8074a9dbd66b0460f56e4906cf8fda798f507df6ed380057452e18","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 11 of arXiv:2609.03869, '\bf Sharp asymptotics for a transport model with a nonlocal condition of the Fisher-KPP ty'] The solutions $\lambda(\xi)\in\mathbb{C}$ of \eqref{A4} with respect to $\xi\in\R$ satisfy the following properties:
