{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.121641+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c39523acc92a9b5a62eeb12689239778eb6b67151f9b7ce8f42c2f919fccb81","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:elementary-expansion of arXiv:2608.18293, 'Critical tensor covariance at the Marchenko--Pastur threshold'] For $a_n=d/n$,
\begin{equation}
