{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:35:05.801889+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c582f1314714a6570916e6fed6b8c7b67a1cbdc5027bdfdea1d0d74870606a9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:pr_pentagonal of arXiv:2606.23547, 'The location of the largest exponential spacing and Euler’s generalized pentagonal numbers'] For $r\geq1$,
