{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:48:27.282416+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8cf987c1ce7eb2a818d43186d99c82a6d1c629677c2180fcd8622a33fff56381","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 7 of arXiv:2604.25336, 'Central limit theorem for slow-fast system under mixed fractional Brownian motion'] A weak solution to the following Young-It\^o SDE
