{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.982415+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d93d6446d8971ab907b7487ebac78e866b3e4c0ce346281aaf455633f0b4a77","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2607.13273, 'Asymptotics of transition densities for L\'evy processes with stochastic resetting'] For all $b>a\geq0$ and $c>0$ we have
        \begin{equation}
