        &+ C (2 - \alpha)^{-\frac{\alpha}{\alpha - 1}} \left( 1+\|b\|_{L^\infty(B_2)}\right)^{\frac{\alpha}{\alpha-1}}  \|u\|_{L^\infty(B_2)}+C \int_{B_2^c} \frac{|u(y)|}{|y|^{d+\alpha}} \d y
