{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.575818+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8ec963b2456e9b17fbd02440e0bae5a6c18e5e495bd0c818558ef34d1c897000","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:ML-Est of arXiv:2602.05317, 'Strong local nondeterminism for stochastic time-fractional\\ slow and fast diffusion equat'] Suppose that $\theta+ H>1$, $H\in (0,1)$, and $\beta\in (0,2]$. Then we have:
