  \stepcounter{equation}\tag{\theequation}
\end{align*}
where $\Pi$ denotes the \Levy\ measure, $\overline{\Pi}(y):=\Pi(-\infty,y)$, and $\overline{\overline{\Pi}}(z):=\int_{-\infty}^z\overline{\Pi}(y)dy$.","status":"unverified"}

