{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.890377+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8fb5488649ee6394b96ef2b457e7dd65c79b367f2eb21359a5941865b87e9d49","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 (Kunita) of arXiv:2506.11937, 'Random rotational invariance of integration by parts formulas within a Bismut-type approac'] Let $\Sigma=\mathbb{R}^e$ be the parameter set and let $\ p > min(e,2)$. Suppose that
