{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.989356+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_90ba466ed3964098abd9dba9bca0928980f2c9fa5bc550d8051bc31646703ef4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 (\cite{DiC}) of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] For all fixed $\nu \in (0, 1]$ we have
