{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.844016+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9139714e253d4dbf160420fa3e633d023c2daf9b1a7e535268d25a973dcc3c3f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:ward of arXiv:2608.23742, 'Second-order fusion asymptotics for $\Sine_\beta$ correlation functions'] Let $\delta>1/2$, $\beta>0$, and let expectation $\mathbb E_{N,\delta}$ be with respect to $\mathsf{CJ}_{N,\beta,\delta}$. With $r_N$ as in (equation eq:rN of the paper),
