{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.590569+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_934ba9aac6c416ed1dc4a6f49c3ec065b4fb3e4dbb649cb9a4460ec63cccb43f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm th:2.2 of arXiv:2412.03370, 'TASEP with a general initial condition and a deterministically moving wall'] Suppose $\xi = g_\alpha < 1-2\sqrt{\alpha}$. Then, it holds
