{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:12:08.982977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_934e265b5821345e6397d046826a3c3ddfd9a63dcaf64d48859e9a5dec64a2a8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_hfbmLowerBound of arXiv:2608.17463, 'Persistence probabilities of fractional L\'evy fields indexed by hyperbolic space and othe'] Let $R>0$ be an arbitrary finite radius. For the hyperbolic fractional L\'evy field on $\mathbb{H}_{d}$ there exists a constant $C_2$, such that, for all $\varepsilon>0$ small enough,
