{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.983519+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_935636e4c3375b5f5d298b9ef979a4ca5aa4894b9b0e1343f175fdb56b864386","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary coro_1 of arXiv:2412.03774, '{ Refining Concentration for \\Gaussian Quadratic Chaos with\\ Applications in Sonar and C'] Let $A$ be a symmetric matrix. For every $\epsilon>0$ and integer $m\geq2$, 
