 where $\big(\textnormal{\textsf{Gau\ss{}}}(z_i)\big)_{i = 1}^{n}$ is a centered random Gaussian vector with covariance matrix $(\mathcal{F}(z_i,z_j))_{i,j = 1}^{n}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

