{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:56:11.143294+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94206d2a05990417a144bb366d92ad43743d689ba1d33a689cf6d5a79ee3669d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2608.11071, 'Scaling Laws for Majority-based Opinion Dynamics in the Presence of Stubborn Agents'] The limiting drift $\Delta_k$ satisfies the following properties for all $k\geq 1$.
