{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:17.370293+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_94246f2dc2eece01188f00f3a5d4dea4716591d4327125e0a5a2a1d09a00d859","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 of arXiv:2606.03661, '2606.03661'] Let $\alpha \in (0,1)$ and $\nu>-1$. For a differentiable function 
