{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.085844+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_948dd27fec84f4cced9d6f50513041208a6170dc85fe735b23aadfe7938deab9","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 2 of arXiv:2609.03819, 'Stochastic damped wave and Euler-Bernoulli equations with singular locally H\"older contin'] Assume \ref{H0}--\ref{H3} hold. 
