where the infimum runs over all neighbourhoods of $\phi$.

Similarly, the \textbf{lower AP entropy of $\phi$ along $\bspi$} is the quantity
\begin{equation}
\ul{\rmh}^\ann_{\bspi}(\phi) := \inf_O \liminf_{n\to\infty} \frac{1}{d_n}\log \bbE\frac{\vol_{2kd_n}\X(\pi_n,O)}{v(d_n)^k},
\end{equation}
where the infimum runs over all neighbourhoods of $\phi$.","status":"unverified"}

