{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.677969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96b244956bac015aadcb70670a4de6d399b857820263a74fc90fa8e44102aa71","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop eigenfunction of arXiv:2411.12149, 'Airy limit for $\beta$-additions through Dunkl operators'] [Op]
