{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.708526+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_971feb2f9b518c2abc44ef72a08f0d1e39792e2b6f9ee4555155db03acddc827","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma computation for exact asymptotics of arXiv:2605.29095, 'Asymptotics of the number of components of random polynomial lemniscates'] Let $X$ be a uniform random variable in the unit disk. Then 
