{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:53:30.664191+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_973a515f112280316c089414efa9c6e02425b83dac7d3c06c7359640685e171f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn def:BregVorGrid of arXiv:2506.01746, '\bf Optimal Bregman quantization: existence and uniqueness of optimal quantizers revisited'] Let $\Gamma\subset  U$ be a  finite set. A Borel partition $\big(C_a(\Gamma)\big)_{a\in \Gamma}$ of $U$ satisfying 
