{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.018695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_977015fb3d57ae762f8aa8361a4c231582be55fba073ee00ff941e4e77afbb79","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:deconv of arXiv:2605.15545, 'Crossover from subcritical to critical decay: \\ random walk, self-avoiding walk, percolat'] Let $d \ge 1$ and
