{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.576397+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98244e907893a5b317fca3e8e4265190766fcd594284674f4cdb83b783a1ac43","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2606.14812, 'Joint convergence in Wiener chaos via transport hierarchy and Malliavin covariances'] Let $p\geq 2$ and let $(X_N = I_p(f_N), N\geq 1)$ with $f_N\in H^{\odot p}$ 
