{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.381117+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98331d864d1a414c65c9b9f31a7b09269f7d3d62404ec9f0e9b1cac0845fa00d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2609.04033, 'From configuration spaces to graph complexes via $\mathbf{FA}$-modules'] If $d\equiv 2$ mod $4$ then there is an $S_n$-equivariant quasi-isomorphism:
