\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.080690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98518f659a67e117f8d3892c3df01130b76ceca723f6541bba12debc572f4877","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2609.03803, 'List-distance consistent vertices in trees are confined to a path'] Let $G=SP(w;\ell_1,\dots,\ell_k)$ with $k\ge3$, let $1\le i\le k$ and let
