{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:10.808381+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_985510349913a4646133863216cf078b456e28d127f46890d8b4518d72403554","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] We have that 
