{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.788508+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98fd53c06a296480b6b5db9fddd2a6b842da7d3302ac63aa007c5612b27a2785","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Wiener:caterpillar of arXiv:2606.09228, 'On topological indices of random caterpillar graphs'] In the case of a caterpillar, we have
