{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:19.205370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ac23745a7c2c13ea7466a270a4267a13e6c28c4b4876d1061fda446225ff25f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2608.28991, 'Jigsaw-CRL: Recovering Global Latent Causal Order from Fragmented Multi-Client Interventio'] For each client $k$, let $C_{k,i},C_{k,j}\in\cC_k$ be two blocks.
