{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.497108+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9b479a952a86845ddf097934bfc19781c74a09f9da2484390cfa68af75c8c266","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm Conformal Invariance under ${\rm Aut}(\mathbb{D}, 0)$ of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] For a rotation map $\rho_{\theta}$, the drift term \( b_i(\boldsymbol{\theta}) \) is invariant under \(\rho_\theta\), i.e.,
