{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.084825+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9be1a069b7c06fe467d8c0a6a6fd25ea02e8c335614cf9ec7dd872b82c08e70c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 27 of arXiv:2609.03803, 'List-distance consistent vertices in trees are confined to a path'] Let $c$ be a labeling of a connected graph $G$ and let $u\in V(G)$. Then $u$ is
