{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.557084+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c0565de74bbe7d7eecc8967b131f133de911aee34ff33a2210c130334ba89d8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Push-TASEP-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The seed functions $\psi_{t,r,n}$ and $\phi_{t,r,n}$
