{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:35:04.096231+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c8f635d97fc22c0d5b31f34051085eb1a6feda636c6e981bdb253de864076d4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:packet of arXiv:2608.29403, 'Kac's Walk on Rotation Matrices Mixes in $\boldsymbol{\Theta(n^2)}$ Steps:\\ A Proof Disco'] Fix a global circuit state $\tau$ before any component is estimated.  Let
$P$ be a connected pure-Weyl component with $m_P\ge2$ coefficient
