	 \rcP_{\calF}^{\xi'}\big[ \omega^{\xi'} \in R(1)\big] -  \rcP_{\calF}^{\xi}\big[\omega^{\xi} \in R(1) \big] \ges \pi_1^\delta(\eps , |y|)^2.
