    where $\phi'$ is a Lebesgue density of $\phi$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.412697+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9dcd1daaa275a6e3b89cdfca75a4b34c0ee89807ea08744fc5e6a3d4d9db2a65","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thmd 5 ({\bf{Theorem 3}}, \cite{DenRe}) of arXiv:2606.08115, '2606.08115'] Let the assumptions (G) and (M) hold, $p \ge 1$. Then
