{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.590707+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9e44ddbb1f570f5aeca90fcc57f4f3823d954abc21febfbf784d4fdb03a6c695","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2609.01346, '2609.01346'] For every fixed pair $(n,k)$ satisfying \eqref{eq:nk-range} and every
