{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.338073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9f01053b7b3de66543f84306c49ebf6aef3fc7080f972a92566c5c6c507a2c5f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2607.23791, 'Precise cover times for branching random walks on Hamming graphs: (iterated) logarithmic c'] \begin{enumerate}[label=\textup{(\roman*)}]
