{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:31.007349+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a29679dd430a41010ebcfff8c131208f044be1d1c7ec2f6a13c008334883e8be","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 66 (Uniform capture in $\mathbb D^{1,2}$) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] If
