Moreover, let \(a_n\to\infty\) be arbitrary and choose the strictly
increasing integers \(r_n\), with \(h_n:=2^{-r_n}\leq2^{-n}\), far enough
along the fixed-row approximations that both
\eqref{eq:relative-tilted-diagonal} and
