\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.424019+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a3178a1eaf5dab1ed5eed09ceba54bd30cf12dff5d265b773a7c95ea77904dad","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 149 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] A \emph{discrete Gaussian} random variable $\textnormal{\textsf{\textbf{Gau\ss{}}}}_{\amsmathbb{Z}}[\Qu,
