{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.580985+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a325ab5a2fa9fefefb577187a1f03a6cf7145fa7213c76332617dbae3d546848","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma UpperBoundR of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] The following two upper bounds hold uniformly in $t\geq 0$ and $y> 0$,
