    \end{equation*} (Stated as a conjecture by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:24:20.647143+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a34959ed3c27538a431e8fa80df23ca430a492916354a94e4f3ff252d78baaf6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LemmaGaussianGroundStateConvolution of arXiv:2608.11178, 'A submartingale for the probability of avoiding the origin in one-point interaction ground'] For every \(t>0\) and \(x\in\mathbb R^d\setminus\{0\}\), with
