& \hspace{30mm} + \int_{0}^{t} \int_{\mathbb{T}^{d}} u^{n}(s,x) \psi(s,x) dx ds = \int_{0}^{t} \int_{\mathbb{T}^{d}} u(s,x) \Delta \psi(s,x) dx ds 
