{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.654205+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a70f3ed28a71b356eee40559081a1335bda41229886de349782e6cc86a5a4b32","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6 of arXiv:2607.24561, 'Range convergence and sharp one-arm asymptotics\\for the critical percolation cluster in h'] Let $\Lambda>3$. There exist positive constants $c_{\Lambda}$ and $c$, where $c_{\Lambda}$ depends only on $\Lambda$ (and $d$), such that
