{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.052917+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a86ef8651f6712a4df8df710b3577a80a72314b4b5ebbe6763c886f28b56abc4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 34 of arXiv:2606.16164, 'A Low-Regularity Semigroup Sewing Lemma via Quotient Structures'] For every dyadic parent interval $[a,c]$ with midpoint $b$, the residuals produced by the dyadic recursion satisfy
