{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.586737+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8795f6846a8931079bd51c9e94b8301dfdcf95acc94200797081fc06b73ebe0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eqn.9001 of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] The process $Z_T $ is a c\`adl\`ag $(\mathscr{F}_t)$-semimartingale with the following decomposition
