{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.728726+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a921f80f34cab801210e75d2fe95f9bb65a5e216abb642a4a0738237ec5197e8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem SouvlakiA of arXiv:2412.09290, 'Asymptotics of Harish-Chandra transform and infinitesimal freeness'] Let $A=A(N)$ be a random Hermitian matrix of size $N$ and assume
