{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.949406+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a92f116d44ac7c1955d8c4551a3608fb4ce8a5cbc020e2eca62eac91be73317f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm EL_equations of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] The limit shape flow $\omega$ for $(R,b)$ is the solution to the following system of differential equations:
