{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.046419+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa8842e8e6c3005f94fdb26e0075a09ed44e6546f2057323fc4a69b6830bfed2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lemma of sde of arXiv:2411.14090, '{\bf Exponential Ergodicity in $\W_1$ for SDEs with Distribution Dependent Noise and Parti'] Suppose that {\bf (A1)} holds with $\psi^{\prime \prime}\leq0$. Then (equation sde of the paper)
