{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:35:04.166741+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab929820a4611bee88655ffbab1fadf12d07f2895064e9284711b2524f174866","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:2 of arXiv:2608.30848, '\huge \bf Limit Laws of the Iterated Logarithm Under Sub-linear Expectations'] Assume conditions ((eqLILmomentcondition1 of the paper)) and ((eqLILmomentcondition2 of the paper)) hold.
