{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:22:01.666359+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab962a3e0a79220939b0506bfc91aa0bea14e57a2a9937912bb03e4d37dda3aa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2605.02226, 'Finitely Dependent Processes on Subshifts'] [Holroyd]
