{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.670648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_add1b498064556b48b59583da47453a624af1f07cc3e54e74efa80a832306d60","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 ($L_p$-estimate, $1< p \leqslant +\infty$) of arXiv:2604.24392, 'Numerical approximation of Markovian BSDEs in infinite horizon and elliptic PDEs'] ~

Assume  \eqref{as:generatorf}, \eqref{as:b:sigma} and \eqref{as:int:X:nablaX}.
