{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.163422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_adf3ea681b224b26eebaac70065e48cc1302b5b48f51982fd11d9da82519dc79","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 (Factorial moments) of arXiv:2606.29530, 'Cutoff profiles for colored top-\texorpdfstring{$m$}{m}-to-random shuffles with growing bl'] Assume \(k_n\ge1\). For every integer \(r\) with \(0\le r\le n\),
