{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.787820+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_afb3c836a8251e6b326483a5ce2db98d3f6d249ab1718bde46a59370c280af22","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 7 of arXiv:2609.02261, 'Quantization and process'] i) If the two  operators  $A$ and $B$ 
