{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.647234+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b12b703f3e26af90849a94fb4e180baa3410206cbccb33054bf56d251c405e81","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem SRWestimates of arXiv:2411.13926, 'Random walks on random walks:\\ non-perturbative results in high dimensions'] Let $(Y_t)_{t \in \ensuremath{\mathbb{Z}}}$ be a simple random walk on $\mathbb{Z}^d$ with $d\geq 3$.
