{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.648226+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b33ffb88911cf213f3edc32319508b1f08b87382033f9118fd1310f183f0e85c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lemma:decomposition of arXiv:2411.13926, 'Random walks on random walks:\\ non-perturbative results in high dimensions'] Let $B=\bigtimes_{x\in I} B_x$ be a cylinder event. 
