{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.661916+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b352e8475e10fe5078ab286365dfcee3e3f2f8b4da5939e29274566df3538c10","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 13 of arXiv:2609.03736, '2609.03736'] For a finite graph $\mathfrak G$ on $X$, Schrijver's $\vartheta'$ is
