{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.117261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b55b919ce449da833d37f4918b6a9b8e4cf785e7a7d1c2678145ce6a10541041","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:specular of arXiv:2608.17022, 'Sharp hypocoercive convergence estimates for underdamped Langevin dynamics with specular r'] Let $\mathscr C$ denote the set of functions $f\in C^2(\overline\Omega\times\mathbb{R}^d)$ such that
