				& = \frac{1}{\MagnitueofinnerproductofLunitanduLunit} \uLunit + \frac{1}{\MagnitueofinnerproductofLunitanduLunit} \Lunit + \breve{\slashed{\Transport}}. 
			\end{align}
		\end{subequations}
In particular, we have: 
	\begin{align}
