{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:03:59.200138+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5bed6eafe86776bb96c48e9aa8b2cfcaa79b8c43960e2a1a29b4765951bdb71","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor_high of arXiv:2507.06522, 'Balanced multi-species spin glasses'] Assume (equation converging_ratios of the paper), (equation delta_decay of the paper), (equation balanced of the paper).
