{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.815703+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5ed8e2ecb855941a590978f821f1f35f2dd0744d10d28e5075f5dc1816e6405","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:Y-infty of arXiv:2607.16911, 'Multipartite random graphs with given degrees: local limit, revisiting the giant, distance'] \begin{itemize}
