{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.311597+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6ad75346548df93f39a8dadb57d1e46a691dc0c1da1386aac9f6007d46d1f86","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2604.08127, 'Asymptotics of Brownian occupation measures \\ with unusually large intersections'] For any integer $p \ge 2$ and $0 < \theta < 1/6$,
