{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:11.737759+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b6e68a904b0afe7e19b141967ead089d392bc196ec4f622083ed8ba401058b59","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_flow_1.5 of arXiv:2504.00512, 'Localization-delocalization transition for a random block matrix model at the edge'] Under the assumptions of (lem_flow_1 of the paper), we have that for all $t\in [t_0,t_m]$,
