{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.933550+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8c76bf68f734d834852060e10d5c195adc82eece9433590ba2ae2bff12c10c2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm free_energy_torus of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] The {free energy per dimer} of $\mu_{n,N,w}=\mu_{n,N}(w_1,\dots,w_D)$ is
