{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.721574+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b8d67e63c4011130a33df700247b7f7c768331f3cb24ed7ef066eb9eb1a2e14b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:truncation of arXiv:2608.31043, 'Sharp constants for weak estimates of Riesz Potentials when $0<s<\min\{n,2\}$'] If $f\in L^1(\mathbb{R}^n)$, $f\geq 0$ and $u=I_sf$, then
