{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.747002+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b941c6e4bcb4d208fa4f893fb2052571c32e082ca866af4375f1f06e9e257bdf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2606.11994, 'Sample Path Properties of the\\ Fractional Wiener--Weierstrass Bridge II'] Let $1\le q<\infty$.  If $a_n\to a$ and $c_n\to c$ in $[0,1]$, then
