{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.893675+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb2538716ec5a847b618912fce5d8899f2fc85e69dc5e9d7002d2b2ebc1b95fa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 9 of arXiv:2606.18877, 'Ergodic Properties of Non-Linear Density-Dependent Perturbations of the Ornstein--Uhlenbec'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:main}, assuming also that \(b_0>\kappa/2\), it holds that
