{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.442715+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd6cd8e529f85d71ec2d518ea92aa4b6bf6b4530a75a3b61120767c9e758dd72","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 5. lem: pcpt of aging functions off diagonal of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] For every $l \in \mathbb{N}$ and $\eta > 0$,
