{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.138543+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd8480ad8aedd715ecb8f47b11349d585c0e30fdc9e796360d984bd92f31d25a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 14 of arXiv:2608.27569, 'Laplace and Dolbeault operators on Sasakian manifolds'] We have
\begin{equation}
\left\{ \partial ,\overline{\partial }^{\ast }\right\} =\left\{ \overline{
