{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.300089+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be0c937de83ed61e8877113a22d99ed96be4defd1ea28a2772c1e156ed5f3824","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 (Hyperbolic score reduction) of arXiv:2609.02362, '\textbf{Farthest-cell triplet entropy: high-dimensional shell limits and hyperbolic curvat'] Under \cref{eq:hyper-thin}, the farthest ordering in \cref{eq:hyper-score-exact} is the ordering of
