{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.587566+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be21c97b830e10a812073fc0ffe7831d4d1d80d17a5f316acb44378fe6b1a4ce","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem 11 of arXiv:2608.25164, 'A time-fractional Kalman filter'] For every $t\in[0,T]$, find the unique
