{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.775761+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be242da3267725e14517341f73163ac496754abe098084b3f3057b33847067aa","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:key-lemma of arXiv:2411.03065, 'Growing conditioned BGW trees with\\ log-concave offspring distributions'] Let $n\geq 1$ and let $\mu_n$ and $\mu_{n+1}$ be two probability measures on $\{1,2,\dots,n\}$ and $\{1,2,\dots,n+1\}$ respectively.
