{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.737323+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_beb5c4addfcd4f07137b3038713a81124eb0b912cc6316d646a09f699c7ff179","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2506.10476, 'Construction of ergodic \textsc{idla} forests in $\mathbb{Z}^d$'] {(Global upper bound)}

