{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.182880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf3d84fc7c065d23926e9c8faf38340ca4283276018d8c7a3e952c1ea05633f3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary thm:uniform-exploration-measurability of arXiv:2609.04140, 'The conformally invariant metric on $\CLE_4$ III:\\ uniqueness'] Let $U \subsetneq \BC$ be a deterministic simply connected domain. Then:
