{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:20:07.948026+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf44a48986f34ed7730066b389dc41cc6ce7636592bada17c56b5a4958d94f8b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:certificate of arXiv:2608.30254, 'Exact Recovery Thresholds for Weighted Data Selection\\ in Vector-Valued Linear Regression'] Let $c\in\mathbb{R}^N_{\ge0}$ have support $S$ with $c_i>0$ on $S$. If
