optimal loss, and the ratio is $1$ (also when $L^{\star}_{D}=0$, by the $0/0$
convention).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.414489+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bf4867c0cf69f2351a7ea5bf74266fcd2a89bc256324cbe239a65bc7b8506279","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 22 of arXiv:2606.08115, '2606.08115'] Let condition (C) be valid for a two-dimensional random walk $\left\{ \ov{S}_n\right\}$.
