{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:17.977735+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0418eb6e229d94c936cc43bf07ed5b9e0ed6d72bcfef95aacd1a2c1172f561c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 8 of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] Suppose that the hypotheses in Theorem \ref{Theorem: Main}
